","ja":"タスクリスト生成は、AIエージェントのためのMarkdown形式のタスクリストを生成するスキルです","ko":"태스크 생성은 AI 코딩 어시스턴트를 위한 Markdown 형식의 태스크 목록을 생성하는 스킬입니다","es":"generate-tasks es una habilidad que permite crear listas de tareas automatizadas para desarrolladores","fr":"generate-tasks est une compétence qui permet de créer des listes de tâches automatisées pour les développeurs","de":"generate-tasks ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Erstellung automatisierter Aufgabenlisten für Entwickler ermöglicht","pt":"O generate-tasks é uma ferramenta que cria listas de tarefas detalhadas em Markdown para desenvolvedores, com suporte a múltiplos assistentes de codificação AI","ru":"Generate-tasks - это инструмент, создающий подробные списки задач в формате Markdown для разработчиков, с поддержкой нескольких инструментов кодирования AI","ar":"generate-tasks هو أداة لإنشاء قوائم المهام المفصلة في تنسيق Markdown لمنصة الإي الأجنت، مع دعم لأدوات ترميز الإي المتعددة"},"features":{"en":["Generates task lists in Markdown format","Creates detailed, step-by-step tasks for implementation","Supports AI coding assistants like GitHub Copilot and Claude Code","Outputs task lists in .specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md","Uses Universal Context Architecture for one source of truth"],"zh":["生成Markdown格式的任务列表","创建详细、分步骤的任务以实现","支持AI代码助手，如GitHub Copilot和Claude Code","输出任务列表在.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md","使用通用上下文架构作为单一事实来源"],"ja":["Markdown形式のタスクリストを生成します","実装のための詳細な、ステップバイステップのタスクを作成します","AIエージェントをサポートします。例：GitHub CopilotとClaude Code","タスクリストを.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.mdに出力します","単一事実源としてUniversal Context Architectureを使用します"],"ko":["Markdown 형식의 태스크 목록을 생성합니다","구현을 위한详细하고 단계적인 태스크를 생성합니다","AI 코딩 어시스턴트를 지원합니다. 예: GitHub Copilot 및 Claude Code","태스크 목록을 .specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md에 출력합니다","단일 事実源으로 Universal Context Architecture를 사용합니다"],"es":["Generación de listas de tareas en formato Markdown","Compatibilidad con Agentes de IA como Cursor, Claude Code y GitHub Copilot","Creación de listas de tareas detalladas para guiar a los desarrolladores","Soporte para la arquitectura de contexto universal","Generación de listas de tareas en la ubicación `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`","Nombre de archivo `tasks.md`"],"fr":["Génération de listes de tâches au format Markdown","Compatibilité avec les Outils d''IA tels que Cursor, Claude Code et GitHub Copilot","Création de listes de tâches détaillées pour guider les développeurs","Prise en charge de l''architecture de contexte universel","Génération de listes de tâches à l''emplacement `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`","Nom de fichier `tasks.md`"],"de":["Erstellung von Aufgabenlisten im Markdown-Format","Kompatibilität mit KI-Tools wie Cursor, Claude Code und GitHub Copilot","Erstellung detaillierter Aufgabenlisten für Entwickler","Unterstützung für die universelle Kontextarchitektur","Erstellung von Aufgabenlisten am Speicherort `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`","Dateiname `tasks.md`"],"pt":["Criação de listas de tarefas detalhadas em Markdown","Suporte a Cursor, Claude Code e GitHub Copilot","Compatibilidade com 19+ assistentes de codificação AI","Saída em formato Markdown (.md)","Localização em .specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md"],"ru":["Создание подробных списков задач в формате Markdown","Поддержка Cursor, Claude Code и GitHub Copilot","Совместимость с 19+ инструментами кодирования AI","Выходные данные в формате Markdown (.md)","Расположение в .specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md"],"ar":["إنشاء قوائم المهام المفصلة في تنسيق Markdown","الدعم ل Cursor و Claude Code و GitHub Copilot","التوافق مع 19+ أداة ترميز الإي","إخراج البيانات في تنسيق Markdown (.md)","التواجد في .specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md"]},"keywords":{"en":["generate-tasks","AI coding assistants","GitHub Copilot","Claude Code","Universal Context Architecture","Markdown format","task list generation","AI tool setup","developer workflow"],"zh":["生成任务列表","AI代码助手","GitHub Copilot","Claude Code","通用上下文架构","Markdown格式","任务列表生成","AI工具配置","开发者工作流"],"ja":["タスクリスト生成","AIエージェント","GitHub Copilot","Claude Code","ユニバーサルコンテキストアーキテクチャ","Markdown形式","タスクリスト生成","AIツール設定","開発者ワークフロー"],"ko":["태스크 생성","AI 코딩 어시스턴트","GitHub Copilot","Claude Code","유니버설 컨텍스트 아키텍처","Markdown 형식","태스크 목록 생성","AI 도구 설정","개발자 워크플로"],"es":["generate-tasks","Agentes de IA","listas de tareas","formato Markdown","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de contexto universal","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Claude Code"],"fr":["generate-tasks","Outils d''IA","listes de tâches","format Markdown","développement de logiciels","architecture de contexte universel","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Claude Code"],"de":["generate-tasks","KI-Tools","Aufgabenlisten","Markdown-Format","Softwareentwicklung","universelle Kontextarchitektur","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Claude Code"],"pt":["generate-tasks","desenvolvimento de software","assistente de codificação AI","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","Markdown","lista de tarefas","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["generate-tasks","разработка программного обеспечения","инструмент кодирования AI","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","Markdown","список задач","разработчики"],"ar":["generate-tasks","تطوير البرمجيات","أداة ترميز الإي","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","Markdown","قائمة المهام","مطورون"]}},"owner":"yokharian","repo":"AIBoilerplate","repoPath":"yokharian/AIBoilerplate","stars":32,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-01-19T07:34:48Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-tasks","description":"Creates detailed, step-by-step task lists in Markdown format from user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation. Use when the user asks to create a task list, break down a feature into tasks, generate implementation steps, or needs a structured development plan.","bodyPreview":"# Generating Task Lists from User Requirements\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed, step-by-step task list in Markdown format based on user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation. The task list should guide a developer through implementation.\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`\n- **Filename:** `tasks.md`\n- **Full Path:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`\n- **Note:** Use the same `[feature-name]` as","body":"# Generating Task Lists from User Requirements\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed, step-by-step task list in Markdown format based on user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation. The task list should guide a developer through implementation.\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`\n- **Filename:** `tasks.md`\n- **Full Path:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`\n- **Note:** Use the same `[feature-name]` as the corresponding PRD file\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Receive Requirements:** The user provides a feature request, task description, or points to existing documentation\n2. **Analyze Requirements:** Analyze the functional requirements, user needs, and implementation scope from the provided information\n3. **Phase 1: Generate Parent Tasks:** Based on the requirements analysis, create the file and generate the main, high-level tasks required to implement the feature. **IMPORTANT: Always include task 0.0 \"Create feature branch\" as the first task, unless the user specifically requests not to create a branch.** Use your judgement on how many additional high-level tasks to use. It''s likely to be about 5. Present these tasks to the user in the specified format (without sub-tasks yet). Inform the user: \"I have generated the high-level tasks based on your requirements. Ready to generate the sub-tasks? Respond with ''Go'' to proceed.\"\n4. **Wait for Confirmation:** Pause and wait for the user to respond with \"Go\".\n5. **Phase 2: Generate Sub-Tasks:** Once the user confirms, break down each parent task into smaller, actionable sub-tasks necessary to complete the parent task. Ensure sub-tasks logically follow from the parent task and cover the implementation details implied by the requirements.\n6. **Identify Relevant Files:** Based on the tasks and requirements, identify potential files that will need to be created or modified. List these under the `Relevant Files` section, including corresponding test files if applicable.\n7. **Generate Final Output:** Combine the parent tasks, sub-tasks, relevant files, and notes into the final Markdown structure.\n8. **Save Task List:** Save the generated document as `tasks.md` in `.specify/features/[feature-name]/` directory, where `[feature-name]` matches the feature name used in the corresponding PRD. Create the feature directory if it doesn''t exist. The full path will be `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe generated task list _must_ follow this structure:\n\n```markdown\n## Relevant Files\n\n- `path/to/potential/file1.ts` - Brief description of why this file is relevant (e.g., Contains the main component for\n  this feature).\n- `path/to/file1.test.ts` - Unit tests for `file1.ts`.\n- `path/to/another/file.tsx` - Brief description (e.g., API route handler for data submission).\n- `path/to/another/file.test.tsx` - Unit tests for `another/file.tsx`.\n- `lib/utils/helpers.ts` - Brief description (e.g., Utility functions needed for calculations).\n- `lib/utils/helpers.test.ts` - Unit tests for `helpers.ts`.\n\n### Notes\n\n- Unit tests should typically be placed alongside the code files they are testing (e.g., `MyComponent.tsx` and\n  `MyComponent.test.tsx` in the same directory).\n- Use `npx jest [optional/path/to/test/file]` to run tests. Running without a path executes all tests found by the Jest\n  configuration.\n\n## Instructions for Completing Tasks\n\n**IMPORTANT:** As you complete each task, you must check it off in this markdown file by changing `- [ ]` to `- [x]`.\nThis helps track progress and ensures you don''t skip any steps.\n\nExample:\n\n- `- [ ] 1.1 Read file` → `- [x] 1.1 Read file` (after completing)\n\nUpdate the file after completing each sub-task, not just after completing an entire parent task.\n\n## Tasks\n\n- [ ] 0.0 Create feature branch\n    - [ ] 0.1 Create and checkout a new branch for this feature (e.g., `git checkout -b feature/[feature-name]`)\n- [ ] 1.0 Parent Task Title\n    - [ ] 1.1 [Sub-task description 1.1]\n    - [ ] 1.2 [Sub-task description 1.2]\n- [ ] 2.0 Parent Task Title\n    - [ ] 2.1 [Sub-task description 2.1]\n- [ ] 3.0 Parent Task Title (may not require sub-tasks if purely structural or configuration)\n```\n\n## Interaction Model\n\nThe process explicitly requires a pause after generating parent tasks to get user confirmation (\"Go\") before proceeding\nto generate the detailed sub-tasks. This ensures the high-level plan aligns with user expectations before diving into\ndetails.\n\n## Target Audience\n\nAssume the primary reader of the task list is a **junior developer** who will implement the feature.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:39:09.796Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Assistants needing structured task generation in Markdown format.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Markdown 格式中生成结构化任务的 AI 编码助手。","ja":"Markdown 形式の構造化タスク生成を必要とする AI コーディングアシスタントに最適です。","ko":"Markdown 형식의 구조화된 태스크 생성이 필요한 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para asistentes de codificación de IA que necesitan generación de tareas estructuradas en formato Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les assistants de codage IA nécessitant une génération de tâches structurées au format Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Assistenten, die eine strukturierte Aufgabengenerierung im Markdown-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistente de Codificação de IA que precisam de geração de tarefas estruturadas no formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для помощников кодирования ИИ, которым требуется структурированная генерация задач в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي للمساعدين في كتابة الشفرة الاصطناعية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد مهام منظم في تنسيق Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed, step-by-step task lists in Markdown format, guiding developers through implementation using user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation, and storing them in a specified location like `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.","zh":"赋予代理创建详细的、分步的任务列表以 Markdown 格式，指导开发人员使用用户需求、功能请求或现有文档进行实现，并将其存储在指定位置，如 `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`。","ja":"代理が Markdown 形式の詳細なステップバイステップのタスクリストを作成できるようにし、ユーザー要件、機能リクエスト、または既存のドキュメントを使用して実装を導き、`.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md` のような指定された場所に保存します。","ko":"에이전트가 마크다운 형식의詳細하고 단계별 태스크 목록을 생성하여 사용자 요구 사항, 기능 요청 또는 기존 문서를 사용하여 구현을 안내하고 `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`와 같은 지정된 위치에 저장할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear listas de tareas detalladas y paso a paso en formato Markdown, guiando a los desarrolladores a través de la implementación utilizando requisitos de usuario, solicitudes de características o documentación existente, y almacenándolos en una ubicación especificada como `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des listes de tâches détaillées et étape par étape au format Markdown, guidant les développeurs à travers la mise en œuvre en utilisant les exigences des utilisateurs, les demandes de fonctionnalités ou la documentation existante, et les stockant dans un emplacement spécifié comme `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, detaillierte, schrittweise Aufgabenlisten im Markdown-Format zu erstellen, die Entwickler durch die Implementierung unter Verwendung von Benutzeranforderungen, Funktionsanforderungen oder bestehender Dokumentation führen und sie an einem bestimmten Speicherort wie `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md` speichern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar listas de tarefas detalhadas e passo a passo no formato Markdown, orientando os desenvolvedores pela implementação usando requisitos do usuário, solicitações de recursos ou documentação existente, e armazenando-as em uma localização especificada como `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать подробные, пошаговые списки задач в формате Markdown, направляя разработчиков через реализацию на основе требований пользователей, запросов функций или существующей документации, и храня их в указанном месте, таком как `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء قوائم مهام مفصلة وخطوة بخطوة بتنسيق Markdown، وتوجيه المطورين من خلال التنفيذ باستخدام متطلبات المستخدم أو طلبات الميزات أو الوثائق الحالية، وتخزينها في موقع محدد مثل `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating task lists from user requirements","Creating step-by-step implementation guides","Organizing feature development using Markdown files"],"zh":["从用户需求生成任务列表","创建分步骤的实现指南","使用 Markdown 文件组织功能开发"],"ja":["ユーザー要件からタスクリストを生成する","ステップバイステップの実装ガイドを作成する","Markdown ファイルを使用して機能開発を整理する"],"ko":["사용자 요구 사항에서 태스크 목록 생성","단계별 구현 가이드 생성","마크다운 파일을 사용하여 기능 개발 조직"],"es":["Generación de listas de tareas a partir de requisitos de usuario","Creación de guías de implementación paso a paso","Organización del desarrollo de características utilizando archivos Markdown"],"fr":["Génération de listes de tâches à partir d''exigences utilisateur","Création de guides d''implémentation étape par étape","Organisation du développement de fonctionnalités à l''aide de fichiers Markdown"],"de":["Erstellung von Aufgabenlisten aus Benutzeranforderungen","Erstellung von schrittweisen Implementierungsleitfäden","Organisation der Funktionsentwicklung mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Gerando listas de tarefas a partir de requisitos do usuário","Criando guias de implementação passo a passo","Organizando o desenvolvimento de recursos usando arquivos Markdown"],"ru":["Генерация списков задач на основе требований пользователей","Создание пошаговых руководств по реализации","Организация разработки функций с помощью файлов Markdown"],"ar":["توليد قوائم المهام من متطلبات المستخدم","إنشاء أدلة تنفيذ خطوة بخطوة","تنظيم تطوير الميزات باستخدام ملفات Markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for task list generation","Output is limited to Markdown format","Filename and location follow a specific convention"],"zh":["任务列表生成需要用户输入","输出仅限于 Markdown 格式","文件名和位置遵循特定的约定"],"ja":["タスクリスト生成にはユーザー入力が必要","出力は Markdown 形式のみ","ファイル名と場所は特定の約定に従う"],"ko":["태스크 목록 생성에는 사용자 입력이 필요","출력은 마크다운 형식만","파일 이름과 위치는 특정约定을 따름"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para la generación de listas de tareas","La salida se limita al formato Markdown","El nombre del archivo y la ubicación siguen una convención específica"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la génération de listes de tâches","La sortie est limitée au format Markdown","Le nom du fichier et l''emplacement suivent une convention spécifique"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für die Aufgabenerstellung ist erforderlich","Die Ausgabe ist auf das Markdown-Format beschränkt","Der Dateiname und der Speicherort folgen einer bestimmten Konvention"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para geração da lista de tarefas","Saída limitada ao formato Markdown","Nome do arquivo e localização seguem uma convenção específica"],"ru":["Требуется ввод пользователя для генерации списка задач","Выходные данные ограничены форматом Markdown","Имя файла и местоположение следуют конкретной конвенции"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لتوليد قائمة المهام","الخرج مقيد بتنسيق Markdown","اسم الملف والموقع يتبعان اتفاقية محددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7e31b17a4ffb082b8ff12633bbbfbd71956dbcb4f7e4ec04bda31db9776365ee","qualityScore":62}');
