INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('workleap/wl-squide/best-practices', 'best-practices', 'workleap', 'wl-squide', 'community', 'best-practices workleap wl-squide community i18next i18next-react module-federation msw react react-router tanstack-query webpack wl-frontend The best-practices skill provides a modular application shell for building secure and compatible web applications at Workleap, covering security, browser compatibility, and code quality patterns. Workleap的模块化应用shell基于Lighthouse最佳实践审计，提供安全、浏览器兼容性和代码质量模式 Workleapのモジュラー・アプリケーション・シェルは、Lighthouseベストプラクティス・オーディットに基づいてセキュリティ、ブラウザ互換性、コード品質パターンを提供する Workleap의 모듈화된 애플리케이션 쉘은 라이트하우스 최적화 가이드에 따라 보안, 브라우저 호환성, 코드 품질 패턴을 제공합니다 El skill de mejores prácticas de Workleap proporciona un shell de aplicación modular para construir aplicaciones web con tecnologías como React, Webpack y TanStack Query Le skill de meilleures pratiques de Workleap fournit un shell d''application modulaire pour construire des applications web avec des technologies comme React, Webpack et TanStack Query Das Skill für Best Practices von Workleap bietet ein modulares Anwendungsshell für den Bau von Webanwendungen mit Technologien wie React, Webpack und TanStack Query As melhores práticas para desenvolvimento web moderno com Lighthouse e React Лучшие практики для современной веб-разработки с Lighthouse и React أفضل الممارسات لتطوير الويب الحديث مع Lighthouse و React how to use best-practices best-practices setup guide modular web development with React i18next best practices HTTPS enforcement techniques best-practices vs Lighthouse audits Workleap web development standards browser compatibility testing with MSW TanStack Query optimization AI工具最佳实践 Lighthouse审计 安全模式 浏览器兼容性 代码质量模式 React React Router TanStack Query i18next i18next-react Enforces HTTPS everywhere to prevent mixed content issues Supports i18next and i18next-react for internationalization Utilizes module-federation for modular application development Integrates with React Router for client-side routing Optimizes code quality with TanStack Query and Webpack Ensures browser compatibility with MSW and WL-Frontend best-practices is a set of modern web development standards based on Lighthouse best practices audits, focusing on security, browser compatibility, and code quality.');
