ates release notes from a Linear cycle, categorizing and formatting completed issues for teams.","zh":"Release Notes AI Agent是一种可以生成Linear周期的发布说明的工具","ja":"Release Notes AIエージェントは、リリースノートを自動生成するAIエージェントの一種","ko":"Release Notes AI 에이전트는 릴리즈 노트를 자동으로 생성하는 AI 에이전트의 일종","es":"El skill de notas de lanzamiento es una herramienta de utilidad autónoma que genera notas de lanzamiento a partir de un ciclo Lineal.","fr":"Le skill de notes de version est un outil utilitaire autonome qui génère des notes de version à partir d''un cycle Lineal.","de":"Der Release-Notes-Skill ist ein eigenständiges Utility-Tool, das Release-Notes aus einem Lineal-Zyklus generiert.","pt":"Notas de lançamento são documentos que descrevem as alterações e melhorias feitas em um projeto de software","ru":"Заметки о выпуске - это документы, которые описывают изменения и улучшения, внесенные в проект программного обеспечения","ar":"ملاحظات الإصدار هي وثائق تصف التغييرات والتحسينات التي أجريت على مشروع برنامج"},"features":{"en":["Generates release notes from Linear cycles using the cycle number as input","Pulls completed issues from engineering teams and categorizes them","Formats release notes using Markdown files from the projects path","Supports conventions file configuration from Pipeline Configuration","Uses project tracker config for customized release note generation","Processes previous release notes from `<projects-path>/release-notes/*.md` for consistent formatting"],"zh":["生成Linear周期的发布说明","从工程团队中获取完成的issue","支持格式化的内容","使用Pipeline Configuration中的项目路径和项目跟踪器配置","可以读取之前的发布说明"],"ja":["リリースノートの自動生成","エンジニアリングチームから完了したissueの取得","フォーマットされた内容のサポート","Pipeline Configurationのプロジェクトパスとプロジェクトトラッカー設定の使用","以前のリリースノートの読み取り"],"ko":["릴리즈 노트 생성","엔지니어링 팀에서 완료된 이슈 가져오기","형식화된 내용 지원","파이프라인 구성의 프로젝트 경로 및 프로젝트 트래커 설정 사용","이전에 릴리즈 노트 읽기"],"es":["Generación de notas de lanzamiento a partir de un ciclo Lineal","Recopilación de problemas completados de equipos de ingeniería","Categorización y formato de notas de lanzamiento","Compatibilidad con archivos de configuración de proyectos","Uso de archivos de notas de lanzamiento anteriores para formato"],"fr":["Génération de notes de version à partir d''un cycle Lineal","Collecte de problèmes terminés d''équipes d''ingénierie","Catégorisation et formatage de notes de version","Compatibilité avec les fichiers de configuration de projets","Utilisation de fichiers de notes de version antérieures pour le formatage"],"de":["Generierung von Release-Notes aus einem Lineal-Zyklus","Sammeln von abgeschlossenen Problemen von Ingenieurteams","Kategorisierung und Formatierung von Release-Notes","Kompatibilität mit Projekt-Konfigurationsdateien","Verwendung von vorherigen Release-Notes-Dateien für das Format"],"pt":["Geração de notas de lançamento a partir de um ciclo Linear","Utilização de convenções de projeto para configurar o diretório de trabalho","Extração de problemas concluídos das equipes de engenharia","Categorização e formatação das notas de lançamento","Utilização de arquivos MD para armazenar notas de lançamento anteriores"],"ru":["Генерация заметок о выпуске из цикла Linear","Использование проектных конвенций для настройки рабочего каталога","Извлечение завершенных проблем из инженерных команд","Категоризация и форматирование заметок о выпуске","Использование файлов MD для хранения предыдущих заметок о выпуске"],"ar":["توليد ملاحظات الإصدار من دورة Linear","استخدام الاتفاقيات المشروع لتكوين الدليل العمل","استخراج المشكلات المكتملة من فرق الهندسة","تصنيف وتدوين ملاحظات الإصدار","استخدام ملفات MD لتخزين ملاحظات الإصدار السابقة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release-notes","release-notes alternative","release-notes setup guide","what is release-notes","release-notes vs manual note taking","release-notes install for AI agents","automated release note generation","Linear cycle release notes","release-notes for engineering teams"],"zh":["Release Notes AI Agent","生成发布说明","Linear周期","AI工具","自动化","开发效率","发布说明生成"],"ja":["Release Notes AIエージェント","リリースノート生成","Linearサイクル","AIエージェント","自動化","開発効率","リリースノート自動生成"],"ko":["Release Notes AI 에이전트","릴리즈 노트 생성","Linear 사이클","AI 에이전트","자동화","개발 효율","릴리즈 노트 자동 생성"],"es":["notas de lanzamiento","AI Agent","ciclo Lineal","ingeniería de software","automatización de flujo de trabajo","herramientas de utilidad","configuración de proyectos","formato de notas de lanzamiento"],"fr":["notes de version","agent AI","cycle Lineal","ingénierie logicielle","automatisation de flux de travail","outils utilitaires","configuration de projets","formatage de notes de version"],"de":["Release-Notes","AI-Agents","Lineal-Zyklus","Software-Engineering","Automatisierung von Arbeitsfluss","Utility-Tools","Projekt-Konfiguration","Formatierung von Release-Notes"],"pt":["notas de lançamento","ciclo Linear","convenções de projeto","diretório de trabalho","extração de problemas","categorização de notas","formatação de notas","arquivos MD","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["заметки о выпуске","цикл Linear","проектные конвенции","рабочий каталог","извлечение проблем","категоризация заметок","форматирование заметок","файлы MD","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ملاحظات الإصدار","دورة Linear","الاتفاقيات المشروع","الدليل العمل","استخراج المشكلات","تصنيف ملاحظات","تدوين ملاحظات","ملفات MD","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"dpaola2","repo":"pipeline-skills","repoPath":"dpaola2/pipeline-skills","stars":3,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T13:35:19Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-notes","description":"Generate release notes from a Linear cycle — pulls completed issues, categorizes them, and formats the notes using the previous cycles format as a template.","tags":["release-notes","linear","documentation"],"bodyPreview":"# Release Notes\n\nYou **generate release notes from a Linear cycle** — pulling completed issues from engineering teams, categorizing them, and formatting them for the team. This is a standalone utility skill, not a pipeline stage.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `$ARGUMENTS` — the cycle number (integer, e.g., `47`)\n- The conventions file — projects path (from Pipeline Configuration → Work Directory → Projects) and project tracker config\n- `<projects-path>/release-notes/*.md` — previous release notes (for format re","body":"# Release Notes\n\nYou **generate release notes from a Linear cycle** — pulling completed issues from engineering teams, categorizing them, and formatting them for the team. This is a standalone utility skill, not a pipeline stage.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `$ARGUMENTS` — the cycle number (integer, e.g., `47`)\n- The conventions file — projects path (from Pipeline Configuration → Work Directory → Projects) and project tracker config\n- `<projects-path>/release-notes/*.md` — previous release notes (for format reference)\n\n## Pre-Flight Checks (MANDATORY)\n\nRun ALL checks before doing anything else. If any check fails, **STOP** and report the issue.\n\n### Check 1: Argument Is a Number\n\n`$ARGUMENTS` must be a single integer (the cycle number). If it''s missing, empty, or not a number, **STOP**:\n\n> \"Usage: `/release-notes <cycle_number>` — provide a cycle number (e.g., `/release-notes 47`).\"\n\n### Check 2: Pipeline Config Exists\n\nLocate the **conventions file** in the current repo root — look for `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, or `CONVENTIONS.md` (use the first one found). Read it in full. From the `## Pipeline Configuration` section, extract:\n- **Projects path** from Work Directory → Projects\n- **Project Tracker → Tool** — must be \"Linear\"\n\nIf no conventions file is found, **STOP**:\n\n> \"No conventions file found (`CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, or `CONVENTIONS.md`). This skill requires Pipeline Configuration with Linear as the project tracker.\"\n\nIf the project tracker is not Linear, **STOP**:\n\n> \"This skill requires Linear as the project tracker. Current tracker: [value].\"\n\n### Check 3: Cycle Exists\n\nLook up the Engineering team using `list_teams` (search for \"Engineering\"). Then use `list_cycles` on that team to find the target cycle by number.\n\nTry `list_cycles` with type `current` first. If the target cycle number isn''t in the current cycle, try `previous`, then `next`.\n\nIf the cycle is not found across all three queries, **STOP**:\n\n> \"Cycle $ARGUMENTS not found on the Engineering team. Available cycles: [list what you found].\"\n\nRecord the cycle''s **start date**, **end date**, and **ID** for later use.\n\n## Step-by-Step Procedure\n\n### Step 1: Read Previous Release Notes (Template Discovery)\n\nCheck for existing release notes:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p <projects-path>/release-notes\n```\n\nUse Glob to find `<projects-path>/release-notes/*.md`. If files exist, read the most recent one (sorted by filename, which includes the date). This becomes your **format template** — match its structure, tone, section headings, and bullet style.\n\nIf no previous files exist, use the **Built-In Template** (see below).\n\n### Step 2: Look Up Teams and Cycles\n\nFind the four engineering teams using `list_teams`:\n- **Engineering** (the primary team — cycle numbers match user-facing cycle numbers)\n- **Web**\n- **iOS**\n- **Android**\n\nFor each team found, look up the target cycle. The Engineering team''s cycle is already found from Pre-Flight Check 3. For the other teams, search for a cycle with the same number or overlapping date range.\n\nNot all teams may have a matching cycle — that''s OK. Record which teams have cycles and which don''t.\n\n### Step 3: Fetch Completed Issues\n\nFor each team that has a matching cycle, fetch issues in \"Done\" and \"Pending Release\" statuses:\n\n1. First, use `list_issue_statuses` for each team to find the exact status names/IDs for completed states (look for statuses of type \"completed\" — typically \"Done\"). Also look for any status named \"Pending Release\" or similar.\n\n2. Then use `list_issues` with the team and cycle filters, filtered to those completed statuses.\n\nCollect all issues across all teams. For each issue, record:\n- Title\n- Team (Engineering, Web, iOS, Android)\n- Labels (if any)\n- Issue identifier (e.g., `ENG-123`)\n\n### Step 4: Categorize Issues\n\nGroup issues into three categories using this priority order:\n\n**Priority 1 — Label-based (most reliable):**\n\n| Label Pattern | Category |\n|---------------|----------|\n| \"feature\", \"enhancement\" | New Features |\n| \"bug\", \"fix\" | Maintenance |\n| \"tech-debt\", \"cleanup\", \"deprecation\", \"chore\" | Cleaning Up |\n\n**Priority 2 — Title keyword heuristics:**\n\n| Title Pattern | Category |\n|---------------|----------|\n| Starts with or contains: \"Add\", \"New\", \"Introduce\", \"Launch\", \"Enable\" | New Features |\n| Starts with or contains: \"Fix\", \"Resolve\", \"Update\", \"Improve\", \"Upgrade\", \"Patch\" | Maintenance |\n| Starts with or contains: \"Remove\", \"Delete\", \"Clean\", \"Deprecate\", \"Refactor\", \"Drop\" | Cleaning Up |\n\n**Priority 3 — Default:**\n\nIf neither labels nor title keywords match, default to **Maintenance**.\n\n**Internal flagging:**\n\nFlag issues that appear to be internal/engineering-only (not customer-facing) with `[INTERNAL?]` in the draft. Heuristics for internal items:\n- Title mentions \"refactor\", \"tech debt\", \"CI\", \"pipeline\", \"deploy\", \"infrastructure\", \"migration\" (without user-facing context)\n- Labels include \"internal\", \"devops\", \"infra\"\n\nThese flags help the operator decide what to include in the final notes.\n\n### Step 5: Rewrite Issue Titles\n\nTransform Linear issue titles into customer-friendly descriptions:\n\n- Remove prefixes like \"Fix:\", \"Bug:\", \"Feature:\" — incorporate them naturally\n- Replace internal jargon with user-facing language\n- Focus on what changed for the user, not how it was implemented\n- Keep descriptions concise (one sentence)\n- For bug fixes, describe what works now, not what was broken\n\nExamples:\n- `\"Fix: PDF export crashes when area has no inspections\"` → `Fixed an issue where PDF exports could fail for areas without recent inspections`\n- `\"Add inspection schedule limit setting\"` → `**Inspection Schedule Limit** - Administrators can now set a maximum number of inspections that can be scheduled per area`\n- `\"Remove deprecated v3 API endpoints\"` → `Retired legacy API v3 endpoints (replaced by v4)`\n\n### Step 6: Ask for Mobile Build Numbers\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion` to ask the operator:\n\n1. **Current iOS build version** (e.g., \"5.2.1 (Build 847)\")\n2. **Current Android build version** (e.g., \"5.2.1 (Build 312)\")\n\nPresent as a single question with two text fields. If the operator doesn''t have them yet, they can enter \"TBD\" and fill them in later.\n\n### Step 7: Write Release Notes\n\nGenerate the release notes file. Use the format from the previous cycle''s notes (Step 1) if available, otherwise use the Built-In Template.\n\n**Filename:** `<projects-path>/release-notes/<end-date>-cycle-<N>.md`\n\nWhere `<end-date>` is the cycle end date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format and `<N>` is the cycle number.\n\nWrite the file.\n\n### Step 8: Present Draft Summary\n\nTell the operator:\n\n1. The file path where notes were written\n2. Summary: number of issues categorized (X new features, Y maintenance, Z cleanup)\n3. Which teams had cycles (and which didn''t)\n4. Any items flagged `[INTERNAL?]` — list them so the operator can decide whether to keep or remove\n5. Remind them: \"Review and wordsmith the descriptions before posting. Remove `[INTERNAL?]` flags — either delete the item or remove the flag to keep it.\"\n\n## Built-In Template\n\nUse this template when no previous release notes exist in the `release-notes/` directory:\n\n```markdown\n# Release Notes for Cycle {N} ({start_date} - {end_date})\n\n## Mobile App Builds\n\n* **iOS**: {ios_version}\n* **Android**: {android_version}\n\n## Links\n\n* [iOS in the App Store]({ios_app_store_url})\n* [Android in the Google Play Store]({google_play_store_url})\n\n## New Features\n\n* **{Feature Name}** - {Customer-friendly description of what''s new}\n\n## Maintenance\n\n* {Customer-friendly description of fix or improvement}\n\n## Cleaning Up\n\n* {Description of removal or deprecation}\n```\n\n**Format notes:**\n- Use `*` for bullet points (not `-`)\n- Bold the feature name in New Features (e.g., `**Feature Name** - description`)\n- Maintenance and Cleaning Up items don''t need bold names — just descriptions\n- Dates in the header use the format from the cycle data (e.g., \"Jan 27 - Feb 3, 2026\")\n- If a category has no items, omit that section entirely\n\n## What NOT To Do\n\n- **Do not post or publish the notes.** Write them to a file — the operator posts them after review.\n- **Do not prompt for each issue individually.** Categorize in batch, review at the end.\n- **Do not include issue identifiers** (like `ENG-123`) in the output — release notes are customer-facing.\n- **Do not make up issues.** Only include issues that came from the Linear cycle query.\n- **Do not include cancelled or backlog issues.** Only \"Done\" and \"Pending Release\" statuses.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:06:53.601Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated release note generation from Linear cycles.","zh":"适用于需要从 Linear 周期自动生成发布说明的开发代理","ja":"Linear サイクルから自動でリリースノートを生成する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Linear 주기에서 자동으로 릴리스 노트를 생성해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren la generación automática de notas de lanzamiento desde ciclos de Linear.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une génération automatisée de notes de version à partir de cycles Linear.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Versionshinweisen aus Linear-Zyklen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem geração automática de notas de lançamento a partir de ciclos Lineares.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного создания заметок о выпуске из циклов Linear.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يتطلبون توليد ملاحظات الإصدار الآلي من الدورات الخطية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate release notes from completed issues in Linear cycles, categorizing and formatting them using Markdown files, and leveraging project tracker configurations and conventions files for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理生成来自 Linear 周期完成问题的发布说明，使用 Markdown 文件对其进行分类和格式化，并利用项目跟踪器配置和约定文件实现无缝集成","ja":"Linear サイクルで完了した問題からリリースノートを生成し、Markdown ファイルを使用してこれらを分類してフォーマットし、プロジェクトトラッカーの設定と規約ファイルを利用してシームレスに統合する機能をエージェントに与える","ko":"Linear 주기에서 완료된 문제에서 릴리스 노트를 생성하고, Markdown 파일을 사용하여 분류하고 서식화하며, 프로젝트 트래커 구성 및 규약 파일을 활용하여无缝 통합을 구현하는 에이전트를赋予权限","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar notas de lanzamiento desde problemas completados en ciclos de Linear, categorizándolos y formateándolos utilizando archivos Markdown, y aprovechando configuraciones de seguimiento de proyectos y archivos de convenciones para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des notes de version à partir de problèmes terminés dans des cycles Linear, en les catégorisant et en les formatant à l''aide de fichiers Markdown, et en exploitant les configurations de suivi de projet et les fichiers de conventions pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Versionshinweise aus abgeschlossenen Problemen in Linear-Zyklen zu generieren, indem sie diese kategorisieren und mit Hilfe von Markdown-Dateien formatieren, und Projekt-Tracker-Konfigurationen und Konventionsdateien für eine nahtlose Integration nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar notas de lançamento a partir de problemas concluídos em ciclos Lineares, categorizando e formatando-os usando arquivos Markdown, e aproveitando configurações de rastreador de projeto e convenções de arquivos para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать заметки о выпуске из завершенных задач в циклах Linear, категоризируя и форматируя их с помощью файлов Markdown, и использует конфигурации отслеживания проекта и файлы соглашений для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد ملاحظات الإصدار من القضايا المكتملة في الدورات الخطية، وتصنيفها وتدوينها باستخدام ملفات Markdown، واستخدام تكوينات متابعة المشروع وملفات الاتفاقيات من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating release note generation from Linear cycles","Formatting completed issues for engineering teams","Categorizing release notes using project tracker configurations"],"zh":["从 Linear 周期自动生成发布说明","为工程团队格式化已完成的问题","使用项目跟踪器配置对发布说明进行分类"],"ja":["Linear サイクルからリリースノートを自動生成する","エンジニアリングチームのために完了した問題をフォーマットする","プロジェクトトラッカーの設定を使用してリリースノートを分類する"],"ko":["Linear 주기에서 릴리스 노트를 자동으로 생성하는こと","엔지니어링 팀을 위한 완료된 문제의 서식화","프로젝트 트래커 구성 사용 릴리스 노트 분류"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de notas de lanzamiento desde ciclos de Linear","Formato de problemas completados para equipos de ingeniería","Categorización de notas de lanzamiento utilizando configuraciones de seguimiento de proyectos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de notes de version à partir de cycles Linear","Formatage de problèmes terminés pour les équipes d''ingénierie","Catégorisation de notes de version à l''aide de configurations de suivi de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Versionshinweisen aus Linear-Zyklen","Formatierung abgeschlossener Probleme für Ingenieurteams","Kategorisierung von Versionshinweisen unter Verwendung von Projekt-Tracker-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de notas de lançamento a partir de ciclos Lineares","Formatar problemas concluídos para equipes de engenharia","Categorizar notas de lançamento usando configurações de rastreador de projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание заметок о выпуске из циклов Linear","Форматировать завершенные задачи для инженерных команд","Категоризировать заметки о выпуске, используя конфигурации отслеживания проекта"],"ar":["توليد ملاحظات الإصدار آلياً من الدورات الخطية","تنسيق القضايا المكتملة للفرق الهندسية","تصنيف ملاحظات الإصدار باستخدام إعدادات متابعة المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear cycle number as input","Needs access to project conventions file and tracker config","Limited to Markdown file format for release notes"],"zh":["需要 Linear 周期编号作为输入","需要访问项目约定文件和跟踪器配置","仅限于 Markdown 文件格式用于发布说明"],"ja":["Linear サイクル番号を入力として必要とする","プロジェクト規約ファイルとトラッカー設定へのアクセスが必要","リリースノートは Markdown ファイル形式のみに限定される"],"ko":["Linear 주기 번호를 입력으로 필요로 함","프로젝트 규약 파일 및 트래커 설정에 대한 액세스 필요","릴리스 노트는 Markdown 파일 형식으로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere el número de ciclo de Linear como entrada","Necesita acceso al archivo de convenciones del proyecto y a la configuración del seguimiento","Limitado al formato de archivo Markdown para notas de lanzamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite le numéro de cycle Linear comme entrée","A besoin d''un accès au fichier de conventions du projet et à la configuration de suivi","Limité au format de fichier Markdown pour les notes de version"],"de":["Benötigt die Linear-Zyklennummer als Eingabe","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projekt-Konventionsdatei und die Tracker-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf das Markdown-Dateiformat für Versionshinweise"],"pt":["Exige o número do ciclo Linear como entrada","Necessita acesso ao arquivo de convenções do projeto e configuração do rastreador","Limitado ao formato de arquivo Markdown para notas de lançamento"],"ru":["Требует номера цикла Linear в качестве входных данных","Требует доступа к файлу соглашений проекта и конфигурации отслеживания","Ограничен форматом файла Markdown для заметок о выпуске"],"ar":["يتطلب رقم الدورة الخطية كمدخل","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى ملف اتفاقيات المشروع وتكوين المتابعة","محدود بتنسيق ملف Markdown لملاحظات الإصدار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"58aa787148e489a4f97a11bce61283601bd6f55b3a2c4ad7d749d202c7f1549b","qualityScore":62}');
