sts, die LazyVim verwendet","pt":"go-testing é uma ferramenta de teste de unidade para Go","ru":"go-testing - это инструмент для создания юнит-тестов в Go","ar":"go-testing هو أداة لاختبار الوحدة في Go"},"features":{"en":["Writes Go unit tests for multiple test cases","Tests Bubbletea TUI components for user interface validation","Creates table-driven tests for standardized test case management","Adds integration tests for comprehensive application testing","Utilizes golden file testing for expected output validation"],"zh":["支持单元测试","支持表驱动测试","支持集成测试","支持 golden file 测试","使用 LazyVim 配置"],"ja":["ユニットテストをサポート","テーブル駆動テストをサポート","統合テストをサポート","ゴールデンファイルテストをサポート","LazyVim 構成を使用"],"ko":["단위 테스트 지원","표驱동 테스트 지원","통합 테스트 지원","골든 파일 테스트 지원","LazyVim 설정 사용"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias de Go con LazyVim","Patrones de testing para casos de prueba múltiples","Testing de componentes TUI de Bubbletea","Pruebas de integración y testing de archivos de oro","Uso de tablas para testing de casos de prueba"],"fr":["Tests unitaires Go avec LazyVim","Modèles de testing pour les cas de test multiples","Testing de composants TUI de Bubbletea","Tests d''intégration et testing de fichiers de référence","Utilisation de tableaux pour les tests de cas de test"],"de":["Go-Tests mit LazyVim","Testmuster für multiple Testfälle","Testing von Bubbletea-TUI-Komponenten","Integrationstests und Gold-File-Testing","Verwendung von Tabellen für Testfälle"],"pt":["Testes de tabela para múltiplos casos de teste","Testes de integração para garantir a funcionalidade","Suporte a testes de unidade em Go","Criação de testes de tabela personalizados","Integração com golden file testing"],"ru":["Тесты с использованием таблиц для множества тестовых случаев","Интеграционные тесты для обеспечения функциональности","Поддержка юнит-тестов в Go","Создание пользовательских тестов с использованием таблиц","Интеграция с golden file testing"],"ar":["اختبارات الجدول لمجموعة من casos de teste","اختبارات التكامل لضمان الوظيفة","دعم اختبارات الوحدة في Go","إنشاء اختبارات الجدول المخصصة","التكامل مع اختبار الملف الذهبي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use go-testing","go-testing setup guide","go unit testing best practices","go-testing vs ginkgo","go-testing install","what is go-testing","go-testing alternative","go-testing for AI agents"],"zh":["Go 测试","LazyVim","单元测试","表驱动测试","集成测试","Go 语言测试","AIエージェント","Go 测试框架"],"ja":["Go テスト","LazyVim","ユニットテスト","テーブル駆動テスト","統合テスト","Go 言語テスト","AIエージェント","Go テストフレームワーク"],"ko":["Go 테스트","LazyVim","단위 테스트","표驱동 테스트","통합 테스트","Go 언어 테스트","AI 에이전트","Go 테스트 프레임워크"],"es":["pruebas unitarias de Go","LazyVim","testing de Go","patrones de testing","Bubbletea TUI","pruebas de integración","testing de archivos de oro","configuración de testing","mejores prácticas de testing"],"fr":["tests unitaires Go","LazyVim","testing Go","modèles de testing","Bubbletea TUI","tests d''intégration","testing de fichiers de référence","configuration de testing","meilleures pratiques de testing"],"de":["Go-Tests","LazyVim","Go-Testing","Testmuster","Bubbletea-TUI","Integrationstests","Gold-File-Testing","Testkonfiguration","Best Practices für Testing"],"pt":["go-testing","testes de unidade em Go","testes de tabela","testes de integração","golden file testing","desenvolvimento de software em Go","ferramentas de teste em Go"],"ru":["go-testing","юнит-тесты в Go","тесты с использованием таблиц","интеграционные тесты","golden file testing","разработка программного обеспечения на Go","инструменты для тестирования в Go"],"ar":["go-testing","اختبارات الوحدة في Go","اختبارات الجدول","اختبارات التكامل","اختبار الملف الذهبي","تطوير البرمجيات في Go","أدوات الاختبار في Go"]}},"owner":"Gentleman-Programming","repo":"Gentleman.Dots","repoPath":"Gentleman-Programming/Gentleman.Dots","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.283Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"go-testing","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Writing Go unit tests\n- Testing Bubbletea TUI components\n- Creating table-driven tests\n- Adding integration tests\n- Using golden file testing\n\n---\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Table-Driven Tests\n\nStandard Go pattern for multiple test cases:\n\n```go\nfunc TestSomething(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name     string\n        input    string\n        expected string\n        wantErr  bool\n    }{\n        {\n            name:     \"valid input","body":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Writing Go unit tests\n- Testing Bubbletea TUI components\n- Creating table-driven tests\n- Adding integration tests\n- Using golden file testing\n\n---\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Table-Driven Tests\n\nStandard Go pattern for multiple test cases:\n\n```go\nfunc TestSomething(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name     string\n        input    string\n        expected string\n        wantErr  bool\n    }{\n        {\n            name:     \"valid input\",\n            input:    \"hello\",\n            expected: \"HELLO\",\n            wantErr:  false,\n        },\n        {\n            name:     \"empty input\",\n            input:    \"\",\n            expected: \"\",\n            wantErr:  true,\n        },\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            result, err := ProcessInput(tt.input)\n\n            if (err != nil) != tt.wantErr {\n                t.Errorf(\"error = %v, wantErr %v\", err, tt.wantErr)\n                return\n            }\n\n            if result != tt.expected {\n                t.Errorf(\"got %q, want %q\", result, tt.expected)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Bubbletea Model Testing\n\nTest Model state transitions directly:\n\n```go\nfunc TestModelUpdate(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n\n    // Simulate key press\n    newModel, _ := m.Update(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter})\n    m = newModel.(Model)\n\n    if m.Screen != ScreenMainMenu {\n        t.Errorf(\"expected ScreenMainMenu, got %v\", m.Screen)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Teatest Integration Tests\n\nUse Charmbracelet''s teatest for TUI testing:\n\n```go\nfunc TestInteractiveFlow(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n    tm := teatest.NewTestModel(t, m)\n\n    // Send keys\n    tm.Send(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter})\n    tm.Send(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyDown})\n    tm.Send(tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter})\n\n    // Wait for model to update\n    tm.WaitFinished(t, teatest.WithDuration(time.Second))\n\n    // Get final model\n    finalModel := tm.FinalModel(t).(Model)\n\n    if finalModel.Screen != ExpectedScreen {\n        t.Errorf(\"wrong screen: got %v\", finalModel.Screen)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Golden File Testing\n\nCompare output against saved \"golden\" files:\n\n```go\nfunc TestOSSelectGolden(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n    m.Screen = ScreenOSSelect\n    m.Width = 80\n    m.Height = 24\n\n    output := m.View()\n\n    golden := filepath.Join(\"testdata\", \"TestOSSelectGolden.golden\")\n\n    if *update {\n        os.WriteFile(golden, []byte(output), 0644)\n    }\n\n    expected, _ := os.ReadFile(golden)\n    if output != string(expected) {\n        t.Errorf(\"output doesn''t match golden file\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nTesting a function?\n├── Pure function? → Table-driven test\n├── Has side effects? → Mock dependencies\n├── Returns error? → Test both success and error cases\n└── Complex logic? → Break into smaller testable units\n\nTesting TUI component?\n├── State change? → Test Model.Update() directly\n├── Full flow? → Use teatest.NewTestModel()\n├── Visual output? → Use golden file testing\n└── Key handling? → Send tea.KeyMsg\n\nTesting system/exec?\n├── Mock os/exec? → Use interface + mock\n├── Real commands? → Integration test with --short skip\n└── File operations? → Use t.TempDir()\n```\n\n---\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### Example 1: Testing Key Navigation\n\n```go\nfunc TestCursorNavigation(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name       string\n        startPos   int\n        key        string\n        endPos     int\n        numOptions int\n    }{\n        {\"down from 0\", 0, \"j\", 1, 5},\n        {\"up from 1\", 1, \"k\", 0, 5},\n        {\"down at bottom\", 4, \"j\", 4, 5}, // stays at bottom\n        {\"up at top\", 0, \"k\", 0, 5},       // stays at top\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            m := NewModel()\n            m.Cursor = tt.startPos\n            // Set up options...\n\n            newModel, _ := m.Update(tea.KeyMsg{\n                Type:  tea.KeyRunes,\n                Runes: []rune(tt.key),\n            })\n            m = newModel.(Model)\n\n            if m.Cursor != tt.endPos {\n                t.Errorf(\"cursor = %d, want %d\", m.Cursor, tt.endPos)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Example 2: Testing Screen Transitions\n\n```go\nfunc TestScreenTransitions(t *testing.T) {\n    tests := []struct {\n        name         string\n        startScreen  Screen\n        action       tea.Msg\n        expectScreen Screen\n    }{\n        {\n            name:         \"welcome to main menu\",\n            startScreen:  ScreenWelcome,\n            action:       tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEnter},\n            expectScreen: ScreenMainMenu,\n        },\n        {\n            name:         \"escape from OS select\",\n            startScreen:  ScreenOSSelect,\n            action:       tea.KeyMsg{Type: tea.KeyEsc},\n            expectScreen: ScreenMainMenu,\n        },\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n            m := NewModel()\n            m.Screen = tt.startScreen\n\n            newModel, _ := m.Update(tt.action)\n            m = newModel.(Model)\n\n            if m.Screen != tt.expectScreen {\n                t.Errorf(\"screen = %v, want %v\", m.Screen, tt.expectScreen)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Example 3: Testing Trainer Exercises\n\n```go\nfunc TestExerciseValidation(t *testing.T) {\n    exercise := &Exercise{\n        Solutions: []string{\"w\", \"W\", \"e\"},\n        Optimal:   \"w\",\n    }\n\n    tests := []struct {\n        input   string\n        valid   bool\n        optimal bool\n    }{\n        {\"w\", true, true},\n        {\"W\", true, false},\n        {\"e\", true, false},\n        {\"x\", false, false},\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        t.Run(tt.input, func(t *testing.T) {\n            valid := ValidateAnswer(exercise, tt.input)\n            optimal := IsOptimalAnswer(exercise, tt.input)\n\n            if valid != tt.valid {\n                t.Errorf(\"valid = %v, want %v\", valid, tt.valid)\n            }\n            if optimal != tt.optimal {\n                t.Errorf(\"optimal = %v, want %v\", optimal, tt.optimal)\n            }\n        })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Example 4: Mocking System Info\n\n```go\nfunc TestWithMockedSystem(t *testing.T) {\n    m := NewModel()\n\n    // Mock system info for testing\n    m.SystemInfo = &system.SystemInfo{\n        OS:       system.OSMac,\n        IsARM:    true,\n        HasBrew:  true,\n        HomeDir:  t.TempDir(),\n    }\n\n    // Now test with controlled environment\n    m.SetupInstallSteps()\n\n    // Verify expected steps\n    hasHomebrew := false\n    for _, step := range m.Steps {\n        if step.ID == \"homebrew\" {\n            hasHomebrew = true\n        }\n    }\n\n    if hasHomebrew {\n        t.Error(\"should not have homebrew step when HasBrew=true\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Test File Organization\n\n```\ninstaller/internal/tui/\n├── model.go\n├── model_test.go           # Model tests\n├── update.go\n├── update_test.go          # Update handler tests\n├── view.go\n├── view_test.go            # View rendering tests\n├── teatest_test.go         # Teatest integration tests\n├── comprehensive_test.go   # Full flow tests\n├── testdata/\n│   ├── TestOSSelectGolden.golden\n│   └── TestViewGolden.golden\n└── trainer/\n    ├── types.go\n    ├── types_test.go\n    ├── exercises.go\n    ├── exercises_test.go\n    └── simulator_test.go\n```\n\n---\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\ngo test ./...                           # Run all tests\ngo test -v ./internal/tui/...          # Verbose TUI tests\ngo test -run TestNavigation             # Run specific test\ngo test -cover ./...                    # With coverage\ngo test -update ./...                   # Update golden files\ngo test -short ./...                    # Skip integration tests\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **TUI Tests**: See `installer/internal/tui/*_test.go`\n- **Trainer Tests**: See `installer/internal/tui/trainer/*_test.go`\n- **System Tests**: See `installer/internal/system/*_test.go`\n- **Golden Files**: See `installer/internal/tui/testdata/`\n- **Teatest Docs**: https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea/tree/master/teatest\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:53.041Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Go-focused AI Agents seeking streamlined unit testing and integration testing capabilities.","zh":"适用于专注于Go的AI代理，寻求简化单元测试和集成测试能力的场景。","ja":"Goに焦点を当てたAIエージェントがストリームライン化されたユニットテストと統合テストの機能を探している場合に最適です。","ko":"Go에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 간소화된 단위 테스트 및 통합 테스트 기능을 찾고 있는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de AI enfocados en Go que buscan capacidades de prueba de unidad y prueba de integración optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Go recherchant des capacités de test unitaire et de test d''intégration rationalisées.","de":"Ideal für Go-fokussierte KI-Agents, die optimierte Einheitstest- und Integrationstestfunktionen suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Go que buscam capacidades de teste de unidade e teste de integração simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Go, ищущих упрощенные возможности модульного тестирования и интеграционного тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على Go والذي يبحث عن إمكانيات اختبار الوحدة والاختبار الإدماجي المُبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently write and manage Go unit tests, integration tests, and table-driven tests, leveraging Bubbletea TUI components and golden file testing for comprehensive test coverage.","zh":"赋予代理高效地编写和管理Go单元测试、集成测试和表驱动测试的能力，利用Bubbletea TUI组件和金文件测试以实现全面测试覆盖。","ja":"エージェントが効率的にGoユニットテスト、統合テスト、テーブル駆動テストを書き、管理する能力を付与し、包括的なテストカバレッジを実現するためにBubbletea TUIコンポーネントとゴールドファイルテストを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적으로 Go 단위 테스트, 통합 테스트, 표驱동 테스트를 작성하고 관리하는 능력을 부여하며, Bubbletea TUI 구성 요소와 골든 파일 테스트를 활용하여 포괄적인 테스트 커버리지를实现합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir y gestionar de manera eficiente pruebas unitarias de Go, pruebas de integración y pruebas impulsadas por tablas, aprovechando los componentes de la interfaz de usuario TUI de Bubbletea y las pruebas de archivos dorados para una cobertura de prueba integral.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire et de gérer efficacement les tests unitaires Go, les tests d''intégration et les tests pilotés par table, en exploitant les composants TUI Bubbletea et les tests de fichiers dorés pour une couverture de test complète.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Go-Einheitstests, Integrationstests und table-getriebene Tests effizient zu schreiben und zu verwalten, indem sie die Bubbletea-TUI-Komponenten und die Golden-File-Tests für eine umfassende Testabdeckung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever e gerenciar testes de unidade Go, testes de integração e testes orientados por tabela de forma eficiente, utilizando componentes TUI do Bubbletea e testes de arquivo dourado para cobertura de teste abrangente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно писать и управлять тестами на модульное тестирование Go, интеграционное тестирование и тестирование, управляемое таблицами, используя компоненты TUI Bubbletea и золотой файл для полного покрытия тестирования.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على كتابة وإدارة اختبارات الوحدة Go واختبارات الإدماج واختبارات قاعدة البيانات بطريقة فعالة، باستخدام مكونات واجهة المستخدم Bubbletea واختبارات الملف الذهبي لتغطية اختبار شاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Go unit test creation","Testing Bubbletea TUI components","Generating table-driven tests","Integrating golden file testing"],"zh":["自动化Go单元测试创建","测试Bubbletea TUI组件","生成表驱动测试","集成金文件测试"],"ja":["Goユニットテストの自動化","Bubbletea TUIコンポーネントのテスト","テーブル駆動テストの生成","ゴールドファイルテストの統合"],"ko":["Go 단위 테스트 자동화","Bubbletea TUI 구성 요소 테스트","표驱동 테스트 생성","골든 파일 테스트 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de pruebas unitarias de Go","Pruebas de componentes de la interfaz de usuario TUI de Bubbletea","Generación de pruebas impulsadas por tablas","Integración de pruebas de archivos dorados"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de tests unitaires Go","Tests de composants TUI Bubbletea","Génération de tests pilotés par table","Intégration de tests de fichiers dorés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Go-Einheitstests","Tests von Bubbletea-TUI-Komponenten","Generierung von table-getriebenen Tests","Integration von Golden-File-Tests"],"pt":["Criação automática de testes de unidade Go","Testar componentes TUI do Bubbletea","Geração de testes orientados por tabela","Integração de testes de arquivo dourado"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание модульных тестов Go","Тестирование компонентов TUI Bubbletea","Генерация тестов, управляемых таблицами","Интеграция тестов золотого файла"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات الوحدة Go تلقائيًا","اختبار مكونات واجهة المستخدم Bubbletea","توليد اختبارات قاعدة البيانات","إدماج اختبارات الملف الذهبي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go programming language","Limited to Go unit testing and integration testing","Dependent on LazyVim configuration"],"zh":["需要Go编程语言","仅限Go单元测试和集成测试","依赖于LazyVim配置"],"ja":["Goプログラミング言語が必要","Goユニットテストと統合テストに限定される","LazyVimの構成に依存する"],"ko":["Go 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","Go 단위 테스트 및 통합 테스트로 제한","LazyVim 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Go","Limitado a pruebas unitarias y de integración de Go","Dependiente de la configuración de LazyVim"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Go","Limité aux tests unitaires et d''intégration Go","Dépendant de la configuration de LazyVim"],"de":["Benötigt die Programmiersprache Go","Begrenzt auf Go-Einheitstests und Integrationstests","Abhängig von der LazyVim-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Go","Limitado a testes de unidade Go e testes de integração","Dependente da configuração do LazyVim"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Go","Ограничен модульным тестированием Go и интеграционным тестированием","Зависит от конфигурации LazyVim"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة Go","محدود باختبارات الوحدة Go واختبارات الإدماج","يعتمد على تكوين LazyVim"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"eacbe9a7dbfabf1a9eb39522d812670f73ffc5b8e1bb62f60412f3c18261aaea","qualityScore":62}');
