미디어 마케팅","컨텐츠 캘린더","브랜드 일관성","플랫폼 특정 컨텐츠 프레임워크"],"es":["content creator","SEO optimización","marketing de contenido","análisis de voz de marca","creación de contenido","calendario de contenido","estrategia de marketing de contenido","optimización de contenido para redes sociales","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para marketing"],"fr":["content creator","optimisation SEO","marketing de contenu","analyse de voix de marque","création de contenu","calendrier de contenu","stratégie de marketing de contenu","optimisation de contenu pour les réseaux sociaux","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour le marketing"],"de":["content creator","SEO-Optimierung","Content-Marketing","Markenstimmenanalyse","Erstellung von Inhalten","Content-Kalender","Content-Marketing-Strategie","Optimierung von Inhalten für Social-Media-Plattformen","KI-Tools für Marketing"],"pt":["content creator","análise de voz de marca","otimização de SEO","criação de conteúdo","redes sociais","blogs","calendário de conteúdo","otimização de conteúdo"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Content Creator","анализ бренд-голоса","оптимизация SEO","создание контента","социальные сети","блоги","календарь контента","оптимизация контента"],"ar":["محتوى المبتكر","تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية","تحسين محركات البحث","إنشاء المحتوى","شبكات التواصل الاجتماعي","المدونات","تقويم المحتوى","تحسين المحتوى"]}},"owner":"isdaniel","repo":"MyBlog","repoPath":"isdaniel/MyBlog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.340Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-creator","description":"Create SEO-optimized marketing content with consistent brand voice. Includes brand voice analyzer, SEO optimizer, content frameworks, and social media templates. Use when writing blog posts, creating social media content, analyzing brand voice, optimizing SEO, planning content calendars, or when user mentions content creation, brand voice, SEO optimization, social media marketing, or content strategy.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voi","body":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py` on existing content to establish baseline\n2. Review `references/brand_guidelines.md` to select voice attributes\n3. Apply chosen voice consistently across all content\n\n### For Blog Content Creation\n1. Choose template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n2. Research keywords for topic\n3. Write content following template structure\n4. Run `scripts/seo_optimizer.py [file] [primary-keyword]` to optimize\n5. Apply recommendations before publishing\n\n### For Social Media Content\n1. Review platform best practices in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n2. Use appropriate template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n3. Optimize based on platform-specific guidelines\n4. Schedule using `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Establishing Brand Voice (First Time Setup)\n\nWhen creating content for a new brand or client:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Content** (if available)\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py existing_content.txt\n   ```\n   \n2. **Define Voice Attributes**\n   - Review brand personality archetypes in `references/brand_guidelines.md`\n   - Select primary and secondary archetypes\n   - Choose 3-5 tone attributes\n   - Document in brand guidelines\n\n3. **Create Voice Sample**\n   - Write 3 sample pieces in chosen voice\n   - Test consistency using analyzer\n   - Refine based on results\n\n### Creating SEO-Optimized Blog Posts\n\n1. **Keyword Research**\n   - Identify primary keyword (search volume 500-5000/month)\n   - Find 3-5 secondary keywords\n   - List 10-15 LSI keywords\n\n2. **Content Structure**\n   - Use blog template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Include keyword in title, first paragraph, and 2-3 H2s\n   - Aim for 1,500-2,500 words for comprehensive coverage\n\n3. **Optimization Check**\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/seo_optimizer.py blog_post.md \"primary keyword\" \"secondary,keywords,list\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Apply SEO Recommendations**\n   - Adjust keyword density to 1-3%\n   - Ensure proper heading structure\n   - Add internal and external links\n   - Optimize meta description\n\n### Social Media Content Creation\n\n1. **Platform Selection**\n   - Identify primary platforms based on audience\n   - Review platform-specific guidelines in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n\n2. **Content Adaptation**\n   - Start with blog post or core message\n   - Use repurposing matrix from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Adapt for each platform following templates\n\n3. **Optimization Checklist**\n   - Platform-appropriate length\n   - Optimal posting time\n   - Correct image dimensions\n   - Platform-specific hashtags\n   - Engagement elements (polls, questions)\n\n### Content Calendar Planning\n\n1. **Monthly Planning**\n   - Copy `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n   - Set monthly goals and KPIs\n   - Identify key campaigns/themes\n\n2. **Weekly Distribution**\n   - Follow 40/25/25/10 content pillar ratio\n   - Balance platforms throughout week\n   - Align with optimal posting times\n\n3. **Batch Creation**\n   - Create all weekly content in one session\n   - Maintain consistent voice across pieces\n   - Prepare all visual assets together\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### brand_voice_analyzer.py\nAnalyzes text content for voice characteristics, readability, and consistency.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py <file> [json|text]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- Voice profile (formality, tone, perspective)\n- Readability score\n- Sentence structure analysis\n- Improvement recommendations\n\n### seo_optimizer.py\nAnalyzes content for SEO optimization and provides actionable recommendations.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/seo_optimizer.py <file> [primary_keyword] [secondary_keywords]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- SEO score (0-100)\n- Keyword density analysis\n- Structure assessment\n- Meta tag suggestions\n- Specific optimization recommendations\n\n## Reference Guides\n\n### When to Use Each Reference\n\n**references/brand_guidelines.md**\n- Setting up new brand voice\n- Ensuring consistency across content\n- Training new team members\n- Resolving voice/tone questions\n\n**references/content_frameworks.md**\n- Starting any new content piece\n- Structuring different content types\n- Creating content templates\n- Planning content repurposing\n\n**references/social_media_optimization.md**\n- Platform-specific optimization\n- Hashtag strategy development\n- Understanding algorithm factors\n- Setting up analytics tracking\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Content Creation Process\n1. Always start with audience need/pain point\n2. Research before writing\n3. Create outline using templates\n4. Write first draft without editing\n5. Optimize for SEO\n6. Edit for brand voice\n7. Proofread and fact-check\n8. Optimize for platform\n9. Schedule strategically\n\n### Quality Indicators\n- SEO score above 75/100\n- Readability appropriate for audience\n- Consistent brand voice throughout\n- Clear value proposition\n- Actionable takeaways\n- Proper visual formatting\n- Platform-optimized\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n- Writing before researching keywords\n- Ignoring platform-specific requirements\n- Inconsistent brand voice\n- Over-optimizing for SEO (keyword stuffing)\n- Missing clear CTAs\n- Publishing without proofreading\n- Ignoring analytics feedback\n\n## Performance Metrics\n\nTrack these KPIs for content success:\n\n### Content Metrics\n- Organic traffic growth\n- Average time on page\n- Bounce rate\n- Social shares\n- Backlinks earned\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n- Comments and discussions\n- Email click-through rates\n- Social media engagement rate\n- Content downloads\n- Form submissions\n\n### Business Metrics\n- Leads generated\n- Conversion rate\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Revenue attribution\n- ROI per content piece\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill works best with:\n- Analytics platforms (Google Analytics, social media insights)\n- SEO tools (for keyword research)\n- Design tools (for visual content)\n- Scheduling platforms (for content distribution)\n- Email marketing systems (for newsletter content)\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Analyze brand voice\npython scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py content.txt\n\n# Optimize for SEO\npython scripts/seo_optimizer.py article.md \"main keyword\"\n\n# Check content against brand guidelines\ngrep -f references/brand_guidelines.md content.txt\n\n# Create monthly calendar\ncp assets/content_calendar_template.md this_month_calendar.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:26.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing advanced content creation and SEO optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级内容创建和SEO优化能力的语言代理。","ja":"高度なコンテンツ作成およびSEO最適化機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 콘텐츠 생성 및 SEO 최적화 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de creación de contenido avanzado y optimización de SEO.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de langage ayant besoin de capacités de création de contenu avancées et d''optimisation du SEO.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die erweiterte Inhaltserschaffungs- und SEO-Optimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de conteúdo e otimização de SEO.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности создания контента и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء المحتوى وتحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop professional-grade brand voices, optimize content with SEO best practices, and create platform-specific content frameworks using keywords like content marketing, social media strategy, and brand consistency.","zh":"赋予代理开发专业级品牌声音、使用SEO最佳实践优化内容，并使用内容营销、社交媒体策略和品牌一致性等关键词创建平台特定内容框架。","ja":"エージェントがプロフェッショナルなブランドの声、SEOのベストプラクティスでコンテンツを最適化し、コンテンツマーケティング、ソーシャルメディア戦略、ブランドの一貫性などのキーワードを使用してプラットフォーム固有のコンテンツフレームワークを作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 전문가급 브랜드 목소리를 개발하고 SEO 최적화 모범 사례를 사용하여 콘텐츠를 최적화하며 콘텐츠 마케팅, 소셜 미디어 전략, 브랜드 일관성 등의 키워드를 사용하여 플랫폼 특정 콘텐츠 프레임워크를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar voces de marca de grado profesional, optimizar el contenido con las mejores prácticas de SEO y crear marcos de contenido específicos de la plataforma utilizando palabras clave como marketing de contenido, estrategia de medios sociales y coherencia de marca.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des voix de marque de niveau professionnel, d''optimiser le contenu avec les meilleures pratiques de SEO et de créer des cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme en utilisant des mots clés comme marketing de contenu, stratégie de médias sociaux et cohérence de marque.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, professionelle Markenstimmen zu entwickeln, Inhalte mit SEO-Best-Practices zu optimieren und plattformspezifische Inhaltsrahmen unter Verwendung von Schlüsselwörtern wie Content-Marketing, Social-Media-Strategie und Markenkontinuität zu erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam vozes de marca de nível profissional, otimizem o conteúdo com as melhores práticas de SEO e criem estruturas de conteúdo específicas de plataforma usando palavras-chave como marketing de conteúdo, estratégia de mídia social e consistência de marca.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать профессиональные голоса бренда, оптимизировать контент с помощью лучших практик SEO и создавать платформо-специфические контентные рамки, используя ключевые слова, такие как контент-маркетинг, стратегия социальных сетей и последовательность бренда.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطوير أصوات العلامة التجارية من الدرجة الأولى، وتنظيم المحتوى بأفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث، وإنشاء إطارات محتوى محددة بالمنصة باستخدام كلمات مفتاحية مثل تسويق المحتوى وخطط الوسائط الاجتماعية وثبات العلامة التجارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating blog post generation with optimized SEO","Generating social media content calendars for brand consistency","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for marketing campaigns"],"zh":["使用优化的SEO自动化博客帖子生成","为品牌一致性生成社交媒体内容日历","为营销活动开发平台特定内容框架"],"ja":["最適化されたSEOで自動化ブログ投稿の生成","ブランドの一貫性のためのソーシャルメディアコンテンツカレンダーの生成","マーケティングキャンペーンのためのプラットフォーム固有のコンテンツフレームワークの開発"],"ko":["최적화된 SEO로 자동화 블로그 포스트 생성","브랜드 일관성을 위한 소셜 미디어 콘텐츠 달력 생성","마케팅 캠페인을 위한 플랫폼 특정 콘텐츠 프레임워크 개발"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de publicaciones de blog con SEO optimizado","Generar calendarios de contenido de medios sociales para la coherencia de la marca","Desarrollar marcos de contenido específicos de la plataforma para campañas de marketing"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de billets de blog avec un SEO optimisé","Générer des calendriers de contenu de médias sociaux pour la cohérence de la marque","Développer des cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme pour les campagnes de marketing"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen mit optimiertem SEO","Erstellen von Social-Media-Inhaltskalendern für Markenkontinuität","Erstellen plattformspezifischer Inhaltsrahmen für Marketing-Kampagnen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de posts de blog com SEO otimizado","Gerar calendários de conteúdo de mídia social para consistência da marca","Desenvolver estruturas de conteúdo específicas de plataforma para campanhas de marketing"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию постов в блоге с оптимизированным SEO","Генерировать календари контента социальных сетей для последовательности бренда","Разрабатывать платформо-специфические контентные рамки для маркетинговых кампаний"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء منشورات المدونة مع تحسين محركات البحث","إنشاء تقويمات محتوى الوسائط الاجتماعية لثبات العلامة التجارية","تطوير إطارات محتوى محددة بالمنصة لحملات التسويق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires brand guidelines and voice development scripts","Limited to text-based content creation"],"zh":["需要品牌指南和语音开发脚本","仅限文本 기반内容创建"],"ja":["ブランドガイドラインとボイス開発スクリプトが必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ作成のみ"],"ko":["브랜드 가이드라인과 음성 개발 스크립트가 필요","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성만"],"es":["Requiere directrices de marca y scripts de desarrollo de voz","Limitado a la creación de contenido basado en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite des directives de marque et des scripts de développement de voix","Limité à la création de contenu basé sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Markenrichtlinien und Sprachentwicklungsskripte","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von textbasiertem Inhalt"],"pt":["Requer diretrizes de marca e scripts de desenvolvimento de voz","Limitado à criação de conteúdo baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует руководства по бренду и скриптов разработки голоса","Ограничен созданием текстового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب إرشادات العلامة التجارية وبرامج تطوير الصوت","محدود بإنشاء المحتوى القائم على النص"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f7446716a74d72f9765c5236c8123837ac86fb1e0cb0fad707ce20b790f6c634","qualityScore":62}');
