uxos de trabalho","Go 1.24+","API SABnzbd","keyring do sistema operacional"],"ru":["sabx","SABnzbd","инструмент командной строки","управление загрузками","автоматизация рабочих процессов","Go 1.24+","SABnzbd API","ключевое кольцо операционной системы","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["sabx","SABnzbd","أداة سطر الأوامر","إدارة التنزيلات","تسريع Fluxos de trabalho","Go 1.24+","SABnzbd API","حلقة المفتاح لنظام التشغيل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"avivsinai","repo":"sabx","repoPath":"avivsinai/sabx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.585Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sabx","description":"Control SABnzbd download manager via CLI. Use when users need to check download queue/history, add NZBs, manage priorities, control speed limits, pause/resume downloads, configure RSS feeds, run scheduled tasks, or automate Usenet workflows. Triggers include sabnzbd, sabx, downloads, nzb, usenet, download queue, download status.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SABnzbd CLI (sabx)\n\nControl SABnzbd from the terminal. Covers common SABnzbd API operations.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install (Go 1.24+)\ngo install github.com/avivsinai/sabx/cmd/sabx@latest\n\n# Authenticate (stores API key in OS keyring)\nsabx login --base-url http://localhost:8080 --api-key <key>\n```\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Queue status | `sabx queue list` |\n| Active downloads | `sabx queue list --active` |\n| Add NZB from URL | `sabx queue add ur","body":"# SABnzbd CLI (sabx)\n\nControl SABnzbd from the terminal. Covers common SABnzbd API operations.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install (Go 1.24+)\ngo install github.com/avivsinai/sabx/cmd/sabx@latest\n\n# Authenticate (stores API key in OS keyring)\nsabx login --base-url http://localhost:8080 --api-key <key>\n```\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Queue status | `sabx queue list` |\n| Active downloads | `sabx queue list --active` |\n| Add NZB from URL | `sabx queue add url <url>` |\n| Add NZB file | `sabx queue add file <path>` |\n| Pause queue | `sabx queue pause` |\n| Resume queue | `sabx queue resume` |\n| Set priority | `sabx queue item priority <nzo_id> 2` |\n| Delete item | `sabx queue item delete <nzo_id>` |\n| History | `sabx history list` |\n| Retry failed | `sabx history retry <nzo_id>` |\n| Delete all history | `sabx history delete --all` |\n| System status | `sabx status` |\n| Full diagnostics | `sabx status --full --performance` |\n| Speed status | `sabx speed status` |\n| Set speed limit | `sabx speed limit --rate 5M` |\n| Remove speed limit | `sabx speed limit --none` |\n| Live dashboard | `sabx top` |\n\n## Priority Values\n\nPriority is -1 to 2: `-1`=low, `0`=normal, `1`=high, `2`=force\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Check and manage downloads\n```bash\nsabx queue list --active          # What''s downloading now\nsabx status --full                # Overall system health\nsabx speed status                 # Current speed and limits\nsabx warnings list                # Any runtime issues\n```\n\n### Add downloads\n```bash\nsabx queue add url https://example.com/file.nzb\nsabx queue add file ./local.nzb --cat movies\nsabx queue add local /path/on/server/file.nzb\n```\n\n### Priority and queue management\n```bash\nsabx queue item priority <nzo_id> 2    # Force (2=force priority)\nsabx queue item move <nzo_id> top      # Move to top\nsabx queue item move <nzo_id> to 0     # Move to position 0\nsabx queue sort name                   # Sort by name\nsabx history delete --all              # Clear entire history\nsabx history delete --failed           # Clear failed items only\n```\n\n### Pause/resume workflows\n```bash\nsabx queue pause                  # Pause all downloads\nsabx queue resume                 # Resume downloads\nsabx postprocess pause            # Pause post-processing\nsabx postprocess resume           # Resume post-processing\n```\n\n### RSS feed automation\n```bash\nsabx rss list                           # List configured feeds\nsabx rss add TVFeed --url <rss-url> --cat tv\nsabx rss run TVFeed                     # Manually trigger specific feed\nsabx rss run                            # Run all feeds\nsabx rss delete TVFeed\n```\n\n### Scheduler tasks\n```bash\nsabx schedule list\nsabx schedule add NightPause --set command=pause --set day=mon-sun --set hour=01 --set min=00\nsabx schedule set NightPause --set hour=02\nsabx schedule delete NightPause\n```\n\n### Server management\n```bash\nsabx server list                  # News servers\nsabx server stats                 # Per-server statistics\nsabx server test primary          # Test connectivity\nsabx server disconnect            # Disconnect from all servers\n```\n\n### Troubleshooting\n```bash\nsabx doctor                       # Health checks\nsabx warnings list                # Runtime warnings\nsabx logs list --lines 50         # Recent logs\nsabx logs tail --follow           # Stream logs\nsabx debug gc-stats               # GC diagnostics\n```\n\n## Output Modes\n\nAll commands support `--json` for scripting:\n```bash\nsabx queue list --json | jq ''.slots[0].filename''\nsabx speed status --json\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Multiple profiles\nsabx login --profile home --base-url http://home:8080 --api-key <key>\nsabx login --profile server --base-url http://server:8080 --api-key <key>\n\n# Switch profiles\nsabx --profile server queue list\n\n# Environment overrides\nSABX_BASE_URL=http://alt:8080 SABX_API_KEY=xxx sabx status\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **Full command reference**: See [references/commands.md](references/commands.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:56.118Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-centric AI Agents needing automated SABnzbd workflow management and NZB download control.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化SABnzbd工作流管理和NZB下载控制的CLI中心AI代理。","ja":"CLI中心のAIエージェントが自動化されたSABnzbdワークフローの管理とNZBダウンロードの制御を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 SABnzbd 워크플ロー 관리 및 NZB 다운로드 제어가 필요한 CLI 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en CLI que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada de SABnzbd y control de descarga de NZB.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA centrés sur CLI nécessitant une gestion de workflow SABnzbd automatisée et un contrôle de téléchargement NZB.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-zentrierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte SABnzbd-Workflow-Verwaltung und NZB-Download-Steuerung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA centrados em CLI que precisam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado do SABnzbd e controle de download do NZB.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на CLI, которым требуется автоматизированное управление рабочим процессом SABnzbd и контроль загрузки NZB.","ar":" مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المحدد CLI الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة تدفق العمل الآلي SABnzbd وسيطرة تنزيل NZB."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate SABnzbd workflows using the sabx CLI, enabling seamless queue management, NZB downloads from URLs, and active download monitoring via the SABnzbd API, all from the terminal with Go 1.24+ compatibility.","zh":"赋予代理使用sabx CLI自动化SABnzbd工作流的能力，实现无缝的队列管理、从URL下载NZB，并通过SABnzbd API实时监控下载，所有这些都可以在终端中使用Go 1.24+兼容性完成。","ja":"sabx CLIを使用してSABnzbdワークフローを自動化するエージェントの機能を提供し、シームレスなキュー管理、URLからのNZBダウンロード、およびSABnzbd APIを介したアクティブダウンロードの監視を可能にします。すべてはターミナルからGo 1.24+の互換性で実行できます。","ko":"에이전트가 sabx CLI를 사용하여 SABnzbd 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하여,无缝한 큐 관리, URL에서 NZB 다운로드, 및 SABnzbd API를 통해 활성 다운로드 모니터링을 가능하게 하며, 이는 모두 터미널에서 Go 1.24+ 호환성을 통해 완료할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de SABnzbd utilizando la CLI de sabx, lo que permite una gestión de cola sin problemas, descargas de NZB desde URLs y un monitoreo activo de descargas a través de la API de SABnzbd, todo desde la terminal con compatibilidad con Go 1.24+.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail SABnzbd en utilisant la CLI sabx, permettant ainsi une gestion de file d''attente transparente, des téléchargements NZB à partir d''URL et un suivi actif des téléchargements via l''API SABnzbd, le tout depuis le terminal avec une compatibilité Go 1.24+.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, SABnzbd-Workflows mit der sabx-CLI zu automatisieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Queuverwaltung, NZB-Downloads aus URLs und eine aktive Überwachung von Downloads über die SABnzbd-API ermöglicht wird, alles über die Terminal mit Go 1.24+-Kompatibilität.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do SABnzbd usando o sabx CLI, permitindo gerenciamento de fila sem interrupções, downloads de NZB a partir de URLs e monitoramento de downloads ativos via a API do SABnzbd, tudo a partir do terminal com compatibilidade com o Go 1.24+.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рабочие процессы SABnzbd с помощью sabx CLI, обеспечивая бесшовное управление очередью, загрузку NZB из URL и активный мониторинг загрузок через API SABnzbd, все из терминала с совместимостью Go 1.24+.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تلقيم عمليات سابنزد باستخدام واجهة سابكس CLI، مما يتيح إدارة صفوف بدون انقطاع، وتحميلات NZB من عناوين URL، ورصد التحميلات النشطة عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SABnzbd، كل ذلك من الطرفية مع توافق Go 1.24+."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SABnzbd queue management with sabx queue list","Adding NZB downloads from URLs using sabx queue add","Monitoring active downloads with sabx queue list --active"],"zh":["使用sabx queue list自动化SABnzbd队列管理","使用sabx queue add从URL添加NZB下载","使用sabx queue list --active监控活跃下载"],"ja":["sabx queue listを使用してSABnzbdキュー管理を自動化する","sabx queue addを使用してURLからNZBダウンロードを追加する","sabx queue list --activeを使用してアクティブダウンロードを監視する"],"ko":["sabx queue list를 사용하여 SABnzbd 큐 관리 자동화","sabx queue add를 사용하여 URL에서 NZB 다운로드 추가","sabx queue list --active를 사용하여 활성 다운로드 모니터링"],"es":["Automatizar la gestión de cola de SABnzbd con sabx queue list","Agregar descargas de NZB desde URLs utilizando sabx queue add","Monitorear descargas activas con sabx queue list --active"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion de file d''attente SABnzbd avec sabx queue list","Ajouter des téléchargements NZB à partir d''URL en utilisant sabx queue add","Surveiller les téléchargements actifs avec sabx queue list --active"],"de":["Automatisieren der SABnzbd-Queuverwaltung mit sabx queue list","Hinzufügen von NZB-Downloads aus URLs mit sabx queue add","Überwachung von aktiven Downloads mit sabx queue list --active"],"pt":["Automatizar gerenciamento de fila do SABnzbd com sabx queue list","Adicionar downloads de NZB a partir de URLs usando sabx queue add","Monitorar downloads ativos com sabx queue list --active"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление очередью SABnzbd с помощью sabx queue list","Добавлять загрузки NZB из URL с помощью sabx queue add","Отслеживать активные загрузки с помощью sabx queue list --active"],"ar":["تلقيم إدارة صف سابنزد باستخدام sabx queue list","إضافة تحميلات NZB من عناوين URL باستخدام sabx queue add","مراقبة التحميلات النشطة باستخدام sabx queue list --active"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go 1.24+ installation","Needs SABnzbd API key for authentication","Limited to SABnzbd API operations"],"zh":["需要Go 1.24+的安装","需要SABnzbd API密钥进行身份验证","仅限SABnzbd API操作"],"ja":["Go 1.24+のインストールが必要","SABnzbd APIキーが認証に必要","SABnzbd API操作のみ"],"ko":["Go 1.24+ 설치 필요","SABnzbd API 키가 인증에 필요","SABnzbd API 작업만"],"es":["Requiere una instalación de Go 1.24+","Necesita una clave de API de SABnzbd para la autenticación","Limitado a operaciones de la API de SABnzbd"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Go 1.24+","A besoin d''une clé d''API SABnzbd pour l''authentification","Limité aux opérations de l''API SABnzbd"],"de":["Benötigt eine Installation von Go 1.24+","Benötigt einen SABnzbd-API-Schlüssel für die Authentifizierung","Begrenzt auf SABnzbd-API-Operationen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Go 1.24+","Necessita de chave de API do SABnzbd para autenticação","Limitado a operações de API do SABnzbd"],"ru":["Требуется установка Go 1.24+","Требуется ключ API SABnzbd для аутентификации","Ограничен операциями API SABnzbd"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Go 1.24+","يحتاج إلى مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SABnzbd للتأكيد","محدود لعمليات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SABnzbd"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"05c15f03400133a22dae5fd2fcbe45f9b7245438b8bcef906c6d0492f0651fd2","qualityScore":62}');
