","fr":"Tailwind-setup est une configuration de Tailwind CSS pour Expo avec react-native-css","de":"Tailwind-setup ist eine Konfiguration von Tailwind CSS für Expo mit react-native-css","pt":"O que é Tailwind Setup? É uma configuração para Expo que permite estilização universal com Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Что такое Tailwind Setup? Это настройка для Expo, которая позволяет выполнять универсальную стилизацию с помощью Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"ما هو تيلويند سي إس سيتاب? هو إعداد ليكسโป يسمح بتصميم عالمي مع تيلويند سي إس v4"},"features":{"en":["Uses Tailwind CSS v4 for modern CSS-first configuration","Employs react-native-css as a CSS runtime for React Native","Utilizes NativeWind v5 as a Metro transformer for Tailwind in React Native","Leverages @tailwindcss/postcss for PostCSS plugin functionality","Enables universal styling across iOS, Android, and Web platforms"],"zh":["使用 Tailwind CSS v4 实现现代 CSS-first 配置","支持 react-native-css 的 CSS 运行时","集成 NativeWind v5 的 Metro 转换器","使用 @tailwindcss/postcss 的 PostCSS 插件","跨平台样式支持 iOS、Android 和 Web"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4 を使用したモダンな CSS-first 構成","react-native-css の CSS ランタイムをサポート","NativeWind v5 の Metro トランスフォーマーを統合","@tailwindcss/postcss の PostCSS プラグインを使用","クロスプラットフォームスタイリングで iOS、Android、Web をサポート"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 현대적인 CSS-first 구성","react-native-css의 CSS 런타임 지원","NativeWind v5의 Metro 트랜스포머 통합","@tailwindcss/postcss의 PostCSS 플러그인 사용","크로스 플랫폼 스타일링으로 iOS, Android, Web 지원"],"es":["Utiliza Tailwind CSS v4 para una configuración de CSS moderna","Incorpora react-native-css para la ejecución de CSS en React Native","Integra NativeWind v5 para transformar Metro en Tailwind","Utiliza @tailwindcss/postcss para la compatibilidad con PostCSS","Permite estilos universales en iOS, Android y Web","Soporta la configuración de CSS-first"],"fr":["Utilise Tailwind CSS v4 pour une configuration CSS moderne","Intègre react-native-css pour l''exécution de CSS dans React Native","Intègre NativeWind v5 pour transformer Metro en Tailwind","Utilise @tailwindcss/postcss pour la compatibilité avec PostCSS","Permet des styles universels sur iOS, Android et Web","Prend en charge la configuration CSS-first"],"de":["Nutzt Tailwind CSS v4 für eine moderne CSS-Konfiguration","Integriert react-native-css für die Ausführung von CSS in React Native","Integriert NativeWind v5 für die Transformation von Metro in Tailwind","Nutzt @tailwindcss/postcss für die Kompatibilität mit PostCSS","Ermöglicht universelle Stile auf iOS, Android und Web","Unterstützt die Konfiguration von CSS-first"],"pt":["Utiliza Tailwind CSS v4 para estilização","Suporta react-native-css para runtime de CSS","Inclui NativeWind v5 para transformação de Metro","Permite estilização universal em iOS, Android e Web","Utiliza @tailwindcss/postcss para plugin de PostCSS","Suporta configuração moderna de CSS-first"],"ru":["Использует Tailwind CSS v4 для стилизации","Поддерживает react-native-css для runtime CSS","Включает NativeWind v5 для трансформации Metro","Позволяет выполнять универсальную стилизацию на iOS, Android и Web","Использует @tailwindcss/postcss для плагина PostCSS","Поддерживает современную конфигурацию CSS-first"],"ar":["يستخدم تيلويند سي إس v4 لتصميم","يدعم react-native-css لتشغيل CSS","يضم NativeWind v5 لتحويل المترو","يسمح بتصميم عالمي على أجهزة iOS و Android و الويب","يستخدم @tailwindcss/postcss لملحقات PostCSS","يدعم إعداد CSS-first الحديث"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tailwind-setup","tailwind-setup install","tailwind-setup vs native css","tailwind-setup setup guide","what is tailwind-setup","tailwind-setup alternative for react native","tailwind-setup expo configuration","tailwind css v4 setup","react native css runtime"],"zh":["Tailwind CSS 设置","Expo 跨平台样式","react-native-css","NativeWind v5","Tailwind CSS v4","PostCSS 插件","Metro 转换器","AIエージェント","CSS-first 配置"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS の設定","Expo クロスプラットフォームスタイリング","react-native-css","NativeWind v5","Tailwind CSS v4","PostCSS プラグイン","Metro トランスフォーマー","AIエージェント","CSS-first 構成"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 설정","Expo 크로스 플랫폼 스타일링","react-native-css","NativeWind v5","Tailwind CSS v4","PostCSS 플러그인","Metro 트랜스포머","AI 도구","CSS-first 구성"],"es":["tailwind css setup","expo react native css","native wind v5","tailwind css v4","react native css runtime","estilos universales en ios android y web","configuración de tailwind css","herramientas de desarrollo de react native","tailwind css para expo"],"fr":["configuration de tailwind css","expo react native css","native wind v5","tailwind css v4","runtime de css pour react native","styles universels sur ios android et web","configuration de tailwind css pour expo","outils de développement de react native","tailwind css pour expo"],"de":["tailwind css einrichtung","expo react native css","native wind v5","tailwind css v4","css-laufzeit für react native","universelle stile auf ios android und web","konfiguration von tailwind css für expo","entwicklungstools für react native","tailwind css für expo"],"pt":["tailwind setup","tailwind css v4","react-native-css","native wind v5","expo","estilização universal","css-first","postcss","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["tailwind setup","tailwind css v4","react-native-css","native wind v5","expo","универсальная стилизация","css-first","postcss","ии агенты","разработчики"],"ar":["تيلويند سي إس سيتاب","تيلويند سي إس v4","react-native-css","native wind v5","إكسبو","تصميم عالمي","css-first","postcss","أدوات إيكسبو","مطورون"]}},"owner":"moonLight-7k","repo":"chausar","repoPath":"moonLight-7k/chausar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.594Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-setup","description":"Set up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo with react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Setup for Expo with react-native-css\n\nThis guide covers setting up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo using react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling across iOS, Android, and Web.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis setup uses:\n\n- **Tailwind CSS v4** - Modern CSS-first configuration\n- **react-native-css** - CSS runtime for React Native\n- **NativeWind v5** - Metro transformer for Tailwind in React Native\n- **@tailwindcss/postcss** - PostCSS plugin for Tailwind v4\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Ins","body":"# Tailwind CSS Setup for Expo with react-native-css\n\nThis guide covers setting up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo using react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling across iOS, Android, and Web.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis setup uses:\n\n- **Tailwind CSS v4** - Modern CSS-first configuration\n- **react-native-css** - CSS runtime for React Native\n- **NativeWind v5** - Metro transformer for Tailwind in React Native\n- **@tailwindcss/postcss** - PostCSS plugin for Tailwind v4\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpx expo install tailwindcss@^4 nativewind@5.0.0-preview.2 react-native-css@0.0.0-nightly.5ce6396 @tailwindcss/postcss tailwind-merge clsx\n```\n\nAdd resolutions for lightningcss compatibility:\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"lightningcss\": \"1.30.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- autoprefixer is not needed in Expo because of lightningcss\n- postcss is included in expo by default\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n### Metro Config\n\nCreate or update `metro.config.js`:\n\n```js\n// metro.config.js\nconst { getDefaultConfig } = require(\"expo/metro-config\");\nconst { withNativewind } = require(\"nativewind/metro\");\n\n/** @type {import(''expo/metro-config'').MetroConfig} */\nconst config = getDefaultConfig(__dirname);\n\nmodule.exports = withNativewind(config, {\n  // inline variables break PlatformColor in CSS variables\n  inlineVariables: false,\n  // We add className support manually\n  globalClassNamePolyfill: false,\n});\n```\n\n### PostCSS Config\n\nCreate `postcss.config.mjs`:\n\n```js\n// postcss.config.mjs\nexport default {\n  plugins: {\n    \"@tailwindcss/postcss\": {},\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Global CSS\n\nCreate `src/global.css`:\n\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss/theme.css\" layer(theme);\n@import \"tailwindcss/preflight.css\" layer(base);\n@import \"tailwindcss/utilities.css\";\n\n/* Platform-specific font families */\n@media android {\n  :root {\n    --font-mono: monospace;\n    --font-rounded: normal;\n    --font-serif: serif;\n    --font-sans: normal;\n  }\n}\n\n@media ios {\n  :root {\n    --font-mono: ui-monospace;\n    --font-serif: ui-serif;\n    --font-sans: system-ui;\n    --font-rounded: ui-rounded;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## IMPORTANT: No Babel Config Needed\n\nWith Tailwind v4 and NativeWind v5, you do NOT need a babel.config.js for Tailwind. Remove any NativeWind babel presets if present:\n\n```js\n// DELETE babel.config.js if it only contains NativeWind config\n// The following is NO LONGER needed:\n// module.exports = function (api) {\n//   api.cache(true);\n//   return {\n//     presets: [\n//       [\"babel-preset-expo\", { jsxImportSource: \"nativewind\" }],\n//       \"nativewind/babel\",\n//     ],\n//   };\n// };\n```\n\n## CSS Component Wrappers\n\nSince react-native-css requires explicit CSS element wrapping, create reusable components:\n\n### Main Components (`src/tw/index.tsx`)\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  useCssElement,\n  useNativeVariable as useFunctionalVariable,\n} from \"react-native-css\";\n\nimport { Link as RouterLink } from \"expo-router\";\nimport Animated from \"react-native-reanimated\";\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport {\n  View as RNView,\n  Text as RNText,\n  Pressable as RNPressable,\n  ScrollView as RNScrollView,\n  TouchableHighlight as RNTouchableHighlight,\n  TextInput as RNTextInput,\n  StyleSheet,\n} from \"react-native\";\n\n// CSS-enabled Link\nexport const Link = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RouterLink> & { className?: string },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RouterLink, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\n\nLink.Trigger = RouterLink.Trigger;\nLink.Menu = RouterLink.Menu;\nLink.MenuAction = RouterLink.MenuAction;\nLink.Preview = RouterLink.Preview;\n\n// CSS Variable hook\nexport const useCSSVariable =\n  process.env.EXPO_OS !== \"web\"\n    ? useFunctionalVariable\n    : (variable: string) => `var(${variable})`;\n\n// View\nexport type ViewProps = React.ComponentProps<typeof RNView> & {\n  className?: string;\n};\n\nexport const View = (props: ViewProps) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNView, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nView.displayName = \"CSS(View)\";\n\n// Text\nexport const Text = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNText> & { className?: string },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNText, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nText.displayName = \"CSS(Text)\";\n\n// ScrollView\nexport const ScrollView = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNScrollView> & {\n    className?: string;\n    contentContainerClassName?: string;\n  },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNScrollView, props, {\n    className: \"style\",\n    contentContainerClassName: \"contentContainerStyle\",\n  });\n};\nScrollView.displayName = \"CSS(ScrollView)\";\n\n// Pressable\nexport const Pressable = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNPressable> & { className?: string },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNPressable, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nPressable.displayName = \"CSS(Pressable)\";\n\n// TextInput\nexport const TextInput = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNTextInput> & { className?: string },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNTextInput, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nTextInput.displayName = \"CSS(TextInput)\";\n\n// AnimatedScrollView\nexport const AnimatedScrollView = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Animated.ScrollView> & {\n    className?: string;\n    contentClassName?: string;\n    contentContainerClassName?: string;\n  },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(Animated.ScrollView, props, {\n    className: \"style\",\n    contentClassName: \"contentContainerStyle\",\n    contentContainerClassName: \"contentContainerStyle\",\n  });\n};\n\n// TouchableHighlight with underlayColor extraction\nfunction XXTouchableHighlight(\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNTouchableHighlight>,\n) {\n  const { underlayColor, ...style } = StyleSheet.flatten(props.style) || {};\n  return (\n    <RNTouchableHighlight\n      underlayColor={underlayColor}\n      {...props}\n      style={style}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\nexport const TouchableHighlight = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNTouchableHighlight>,\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(XXTouchableHighlight, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nTouchableHighlight.displayName = \"CSS(TouchableHighlight)\";\n```\n\n### Image Component (`src/tw/image.tsx`)\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCssElement } from \"react-native-css\";\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport { StyleSheet } from \"react-native\";\nimport Animated from \"react-native-reanimated\";\nimport { Image as RNImage } from \"expo-image\";\n\nconst AnimatedExpoImage = Animated.createAnimatedComponent(RNImage);\n\nexport type ImageProps = React.ComponentProps<typeof Image>;\n\nfunction CSSImage(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof AnimatedExpoImage>) {\n  // @ts-expect-error: Remap objectFit style to contentFit property\n  const { objectFit, objectPosition, ...style } =\n    StyleSheet.flatten(props.style) || {};\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatedExpoImage\n      contentFit={objectFit}\n      contentPosition={objectPosition}\n      {...props}\n      source={\n        typeof props.source === \"string\" ? { uri: props.source } : props.source\n      }\n      // @ts-expect-error: Style is remapped above\n      style={style}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\nexport const Image = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof CSSImage> & { className?: string },\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(CSSImage, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\n\nImage.displayName = \"CSS(Image)\";\n```\n\n### Animated Components (`src/tw/animated.tsx`)\n\n```tsx\nimport * as TW from \"./index\";\nimport RNAnimated from \"react-native-reanimated\";\n\nexport const Animated = {\n  ...RNAnimated,\n  View: RNAnimated.createAnimatedComponent(TW.View),\n};\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nImport CSS-wrapped components from your tw directory:\n\n```tsx\nimport { View, Text, ScrollView, Image } from \"@/tw\";\n\nexport default function MyScreen() {\n  return (\n    <ScrollView className=\"flex-1 bg-white\">\n      <View className=\"p-4 gap-4\">\n        <Text className=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Hello Tailwind!</Text>\n        <Image\n          className=\"w-full h-48 rounded-lg object-cover\"\n          source={{ uri: \"https://example.com/image.jpg\" }}\n        />\n      </View>\n    </ScrollView>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Custom Theme Variables\n\nAdd custom theme variables in your global.css using `@theme`:\n\n```css\n@layer theme {\n  @theme {\n    /* Custom fonts */\n    --font-rounded: \"SF Pro Rounded\", sans-serif;\n\n    /* Custom line heights */\n    --text-xs--line-height: calc(1em / 0.75);\n    --text-sm--line-height: calc(1.25em / 0.875);\n    --text-base--line-height: calc(1.5em / 1);\n\n    /* Custom leading scales */\n    --leading-tight: 1.25em;\n    --leading-snug: 1.375em;\n    --leading-normal: 1.5em;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Styles\n\nUse platform media queries for platform-specific styling:\n\n```css\n@media ios {\n  :root {\n    --font-sans: system-ui;\n    --font-rounded: ui-rounded;\n  }\n}\n\n@media android {\n  :root {\n    --font-sans: normal;\n    --font-rounded: normal;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Apple System Colors with CSS Variables\n\nCreate a CSS file for Apple semantic colors:\n\n```css\n/* src/css/sf.css */\n@layer base {\n  html {\n    color-scheme: light;\n  }\n}\n\n:root {\n  /* Accent colors with light/dark mode */\n  --sf-blue: light-dark(rgb(0 122 255), rgb(10 132 255));\n  --sf-green: light-dark(rgb(52 199 89), rgb(48 209 89));\n  --sf-red: light-dark(rgb(255 59 48), rgb(255 69 58));\n\n  /* Gray scales */\n  --sf-gray: light-dark(rgb(142 142 147), rgb(142 142 147));\n  --sf-gray-2: light-dark(rgb(174 174 178), rgb(99 99 102));\n\n  /* Text colors */\n  --sf-text: light-dark(rgb(0 0 0), rgb(255 255 255));\n  --sf-text-2: light-dark(rgb(60 60 67 / 0.6), rgb(235 235 245 / 0.6));\n\n  /* Background colors */\n  --sf-bg: light-dark(rgb(255 255 255), rgb(0 0 0));\n  --sf-bg-2: light-dark(rgb(242 242 247), rgb(28 28 30));\n}\n\n/* iOS native colors via platformColor */\n@media ios {\n  :root {\n    --sf-blue: platformColor(systemBlue);\n    --sf-green: platformColor(systemGreen);\n    --sf-red: platformColor(systemRed);\n    --sf-gray: platformColor(systemGray);\n    --sf-text: platformColor(label);\n    --sf-text-2: platformColor(secondaryLabel);\n    --sf-bg: platformColor(systemBackground);\n    --sf-bg-2: platformColor(secondarySystemBackground);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Register as Tailwind theme colors */\n@layer theme {\n  @theme {\n    --color-sf-blue: var(--sf-blue);\n    --color-sf-green: var(--sf-green);\n    --color-sf-red: var(--sf-red);\n    --color-sf-gray: var(--sf-gray);\n    --color-sf-text: var(--sf-text);\n    --color-sf-text-2: var(--sf-text-2);\n    --color-sf-bg: var(--sf-bg);\n    --color-sf-bg-2: var(--sf-bg-2);\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen use in components:\n\n```tsx\n<Text className=\"text-sf-text\">Primary text</Text>\n<Text className=\"text-sf-text-2\">Secondary text</Text>\n<View className=\"bg-sf-bg\">...</View>\n```\n\n## Using CSS Variables in JavaScript\n\nUse the `useCSSVariable` hook:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCSSVariable } from \"@/tw\";\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const blue = useCSSVariable(\"--sf-blue\");\n\n  return <View style={{ borderColor: blue }} />;\n}\n```\n\n## Key Differences from NativeWind v4 / Tailwind v3\n\n1. **No babel.config.js** - Configuration is now CSS-first\n2. **PostCSS plugin** - Uses `@tailwindcss/postcss` instead of `tailwindcss`\n3. **CSS imports** - Use `@import \"tailwindcss/...\"` instead of `@tailwind` directives\n4. **Theme config** - Use `@theme` in CSS instead of `tailwind.config.js`\n5. **Component wrappers** - Must wrap components with `useCssElement` for className support\n6. **Metro config** - Use `withNativewind` with different options (`inlineVariables: false`)\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Styles not applying\n\n1. Ensure you have the CSS file imported in your app entry\n2. Check that components are wrapped with `useCssElement`\n3. Verify Metro config has `withNativewind` applied\n\n### Platform colors not working\n\n1. Use `platformColor()` in `@media ios` blocks\n2. Fall back to `light-dark()` for web/Android\n\n### TypeScript errors\n\nAdd className to component props:\n\n```tsx\ntype Props = React.ComponentProps<typeof RNView> & { className?: string };\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:04.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing universal styling capabilities with Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo","zh":"适合需要通用样式能力的前端代理，使用Tailwind CSS v4在Expo中","ja":"ExpoでのTailwind CSS v4による汎用的なスタイリング機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Expo에서 Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 보편적인 스타일링 기능을 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de estilo universal con Tailwind CSS v4 en Expo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de style universel avec Tailwind CSS v4 dans Expo","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die universelle Stilfunktionen mit Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de estilização universal com Tailwind CSS v4 no Expo","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы универсальные возможности стилизации с Tailwind CSS v4 в Expo","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تنسيق عالمية مع Tailwind CSS v4 في Expo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to set up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo using react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling across iOS, Android, and Web, leveraging PostCSS plugin for Tailwind v4","zh":"赋予代理在Expo中使用react-native-css和NativeWind v5设置Tailwind CSS v4的能力，实现跨iOS、Android和Web的通用样式，利用PostCSS插件用于Tailwind v4","ja":"Expoでreact-native-cssとNativeWind v5を使用してTailwind CSS v4をセットアップするエージェントを可能にし、iOS、Android、Webを横断した汎用的なスタイリングを実現し、Tailwind v4用のPostCSSプラグインを利用","ko":"에이전트가 Expo에서 react-native-css와 NativeWind v5를 사용하여 Tailwind CSS v4를 설정할 수 있게 하여, iOS, Android, Web를 아우르는 보편적인 스타일링을 가능하게 하고, Tailwind v4용 PostCSS 플러그인을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar Tailwind CSS v4 en Expo utilizando react-native-css y NativeWind v5 para estilos universales en iOS, Android y Web, aprovechando el plugin PostCSS para Tailwind v4","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer Tailwind CSS v4 dans Expo en utilisant react-native-css et NativeWind v5 pour des styles universels sur iOS, Android et Web, en exploitant le plugin PostCSS pour Tailwind v4","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo mit react-native-css und NativeWind v5 für universelle Stile auf iOS, Android und Web zu konfigurieren, indem es das PostCSS-Plugin für Tailwind v4 nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar o Tailwind CSS v4 no Expo usando react-native-css e NativeWind v5 para estilização universal em iOS, Android e Web, aproveitando o plugin PostCSS para Tailwind v4","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настроить Tailwind CSS v4 в Expo с помощью react-native-css и NativeWind v5 для универсальной стилизации на iOS, Android и Web, используя плагин PostCSS для Tailwind v4","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تعيين Tailwind CSS v4 في Expo باستخدام react-native-css و NativeWind v5 لتنسيق عالمي عبر iOS و Android و Web، مع استخدام ملحق PostCSS ل Tailwind v4"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring universal styling for cross-platform React Native projects","Setting up Tailwind CSS v4 with react-native-css and NativeWind v5","Enabling Metro transformer for Tailwind in React Native"],"zh":["为跨平台React Native项目配置通用样式","使用react-native-css和NativeWind v5设置Tailwind CSS v4","在React Native中启用Metro转换器用于Tailwind"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームのReact Nativeプロジェクトに汎用的なスタイリングを設定する","react-native-cssとNativeWind v5を使用してTailwind CSS v4をセットアップする","React NativeでMetroトランスフォーマーをTailwind用に有効にする"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 React Native 프로젝트에 보편적인 스타일링을 구성","react-native-css와 NativeWind v5를 사용하여 Tailwind CSS v4를 설정","React Native에서 Metro 변환기를 Tailwind용으로 활성화"],"es":["Configuración de estilos universales para proyectos React Native de varias plataformas","Configuración de Tailwind CSS v4 con react-native-css y NativeWind v5","Activación del transformador Metro para Tailwind en React Native"],"fr":["Configuration de styles universels pour les projets React Native multi-plateformes","Configuration de Tailwind CSS v4 avec react-native-css et NativeWind v5","Activation du transformateur Metro pour Tailwind dans React Native"],"de":["Konfiguration von universellen Stilen für React Native-Projekte mit mehreren Plattformen","Konfiguration von Tailwind CSS v4 mit react-native-css und NativeWind v5","Aktivierung des Metro-Transformators für Tailwind in React Native"],"pt":["Configurando estilização universal para projetos cross-platform do React Native","Configurando o Tailwind CSS v4 com react-native-css e NativeWind v5","Habilitando o transformador Metro para Tailwind no React Native"],"ru":["Настройка универсальной стилизации для кроссплатформенных проектов React Native","Настройка Tailwind CSS v4 с react-native-css и NativeWind v5","Включение трансформатора Metro для Tailwind в React Native"],"ar":["تكوين تنسيق عالمي لمشاريع React Native متعددة المنصات","تثبيت Tailwind CSS v4 مع react-native-css و NativeWind v5","تمكين محول Metro ل Tailwind في React Native"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires react-native-css and NativeWind v5","Specific to Tailwind CSS v4","Expo environment required"],"zh":["需要react-native-css和NativeWind v5","特定于Tailwind CSS v4","需要Expo环境"],"ja":["react-native-cssとNativeWind v5を必要とする","Tailwind CSS v4に特有のもの","Expo環境が必要"],"ko":["react-native-css와 NativeWind v5가 필요","Tailwind CSS v4에 특정","Expo 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere react-native-css y NativeWind v5","Específico para Tailwind CSS v4","Entorno Expo obligatorio"],"fr":["Nécessite react-native-css et NativeWind v5","Spécifique à Tailwind CSS v4","Environnement Expo obligatoire"],"de":["Benötigt react-native-css und NativeWind v5","Spezifisch für Tailwind CSS v4","Expo-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige react-native-css e NativeWind v5","Específico para Tailwind CSS v4","Ambiente Expo necessário"],"ru":["Требует react-native-css и NativeWind v5","Конкретно для Tailwind CSS v4","Требуется среда Expo"],"ar":["يتطلب react-native-css و NativeWind v5","محدد ل Tailwind CSS v4","بيئة Expo مطلوبة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b330da08fc0a14e6d10cefab041c6bb81b847141c3dd279276ea0c53af9d04ed","qualityScore":62}');
