on es una habilidad para utilizar Neon Serverless Postgres","fr":"Using-neon est une compétence pour utiliser Neon Serverless Postgres","de":"Using-neon ist eine Fähigkeit, um Neon Serverless Postgres zu verwenden","pt":"O que é Using-Neon? É uma habilidade que permite a integração com Neon Serverless Postgres para criar workflows personalizados.","ru":"Что такое Using-Neon? Это навык, который позволяет интегрироваться с Neon Serverless Postgres для создания индивидуальных рабочих процессов.","ar":"ما هو Using-Neon؟ إنه مهارة تسمح بالتكامل مع Neon Serverless Postgres لإنشاء سير عمل مخصصة."},"features":{"en":["Separates compute and storage for autoscaling and instant restore","Fully compatible with Postgres and supports any language, framework, or ORM","Enables branching for efficient database management","Supports scale-to-zero for cost-effective resource allocation","Offers instant restore for rapid database recovery","Works with any connection method compatible with Postgres"],"zh":["自动缩放","分支","即时恢复","兼容Postgres","支持任何语言、框架或ORM"],"ja":["自動スケーリング","ブランチ","インスタント復元","Postgresとの互換性","任何言語、フレームワーク、またはORMのサポート"],"ko":["자동 확장","분기","즉시 복원","Postgres 호환","任何 언어, 프레임워크 또는 ORM 지원"],"es":["Autoscaling","Branching","Restauración instantánea","Compatibilidad con Postgres","Escalado a cero","Soporte para lenguajes y frameworks de Postgres"],"fr":["Autoscaling","Branching","Restauration instantanée","Compatibilité avec Postgres","Montée en charge à zéro","Prise en charge des langages et des frameworks Postgres"],"de":["Autoscaling","Branching","Instant-Wiederherstellung","Kompatibilität mit Postgres","Skalierung auf Null","Unterstützung für Postgres-Sprachen und -Frameworks"],"pt":["Autodimensionamento com Neon Serverless Postgres","Ramificação e instantâneo com Neon","Compatibilidade total com Postgres","Suporte a qualquer linguagem, framework ou ORM que suporte Postgres","Recursos de escala zero com Neon"],"ru":["Автоскалинг с помощью Neon Serverless Postgres","Ветвление и мгновенное восстановление с Neon","Полная совместимость с Postgres","Поддержка любого языка, фреймворка или ORM, который поддерживает Postgres","Функции масштабирования до нуля с Neon"],"ar":["التحكم التلقائي مع Neon Serverless Postgres","التفرع والاستعادة الفورية مع Neon","التوافق الكامل مع Postgres","دعم أي لغة أو إطار أو ORM يدعم Postgres","ميزات التحكم التلقائي لصفر مع Neon"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use using-neon","what is using-neon","using-neon alternative","using-neon vs PostgreSQL","using-neon install","using-neon setup guide","Neon Serverless Postgres tutorial","using-neon for AI agents","using-neon for database management"],"zh":["Neon","服务器端Postgres","自动缩放","分支","即时恢复","Postgres兼容","服务器端开发","AIエージェント","AI开发工具"],"ja":["Neon","サーバーレスPostgres","自動スケーリング","ブランチ","インスタント復元","Postgres互換性","サーバーレス開発","AIエージェント","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["Neon","서버리스 Postgres","자동 확장","분기","즉시 복원","Postgres 호환","서버리스 개발","AI 에이전트","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["using-neon","Neon Serverless Postgres","autoscaling","branching","restauración instantánea","Postgres","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agentes","Agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["using-neon","Neon Serverless Postgres","autoscaling","branching","restauration instantanée","Postgres","développement d''applications","outils de développement","Outils d''intelligence artificielle","Agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["using-neon","Neon Serverless Postgres","Autoscaling","Branching","Instant-Wiederherstellung","Postgres","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz-Tools","KI-Agents"],"pt":["Using-Neon","Neon Serverless Postgres","autodimensionamento","ramificação","Postgres","ORM","framework","linguagem de programação","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Using-Neon","Neon Serverless Postgres","автоскалинг","ветвление","Postgres","ORM","фреймворк","язык программирования","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Using-Neon","Neon Serverless Postgres","التحكم التلقائي","التفرع","Postgres","ORM","إطار","لغة البرمجة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ranbot-ai","repo":"awesome-skills","repoPath":"ranbot-ai/awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.659Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-neon","description":"Guides and best practices for working with Neon Serverless Postgres. Covers getting started, local development with Neon, choosing a connection method, Neon features, authentication (@neondatabase/...","tags":["python","typescript","markdown","api","mcp","ai","agent","llm","workflow","document"],"bodyPreview":"# Neon Serverless Postgres\n\nNeon is a serverless Postgres platform that separates compute and storage to offer autoscaling, branching, instant restore, and scale-to-zero. It''s fully compatible with Postgres and works with any language, framework, or ORM that supports Postgres.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working with Neon Serverless Postgres\n- Setting up Neon databases\n- Choosing connection methods for Neon\n- Using Neon features like branching or autoscaling\n- Working with","body":"# Neon Serverless Postgres\n\nNeon is a serverless Postgres platform that separates compute and storage to offer autoscaling, branching, instant restore, and scale-to-zero. It''s fully compatible with Postgres and works with any language, framework, or ORM that supports Postgres.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working with Neon Serverless Postgres\n- Setting up Neon databases\n- Choosing connection methods for Neon\n- Using Neon features like branching or autoscaling\n- Working with Neon authentication or APIs\n- Questions about Neon best practices\n\n## Neon Documentation\n\nAlways reference the Neon documentation before making Neon-related claims. The documentation is the source of truth for all Neon-related information.\n\nBelow you''ll find a list of resources organized by area of concern. This is meant to support you find the right documentation pages to fetch and add a bit of additonal context.\n\nYou can use the `curl` commands to fetch the documentation page as markdown:\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n```bash\n# Get list of all Neon docs\ncurl https://neon.com/llms.txt\n\n# Fetch any doc page as markdown\ncurl -H \"Accept: text/markdown\" https://neon.com/docs/<path>\n```\n\nDon''t guess docs pages. Use the `llms.txt` index to find the relevant URL or follow the links in the resources below.\n\n## Overview of Resources\n\nReference the appropriate resource file based on the user''s needs:\n\n### Core Guides\n\n| Area               | Resource                           | When to Use                                                    |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| What is Neon       | `references/what-is-neon.md`       | Understanding Neon concepts, architecture, core resources      |\n| Referencing Docs   | `references/referencing-docs.md`   | Looking up official documentation, verifying information       |\n| Features           | `references/features.md`           | Branching, autoscaling, scale-to-zero, instant restore         |\n| Getting Started    | `references/getting-started.md`    | Setting up a project, connection strings, dependencies, schema |\n| Connection Methods | `references/connection-methods.md` | Choosing drivers based on platform and runtime                 |\n| Developer Tools    | `references/devtools.md`           | VSCode extension, MCP server, Neon CLI (`neon init`)           |\n\n### Database Drivers & ORMs\n\nHTTP/WebSocket queries for serverless/edge functions.\n\n| Area              | Resource                        | When to Use                                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Serverless Driver | `references/neon-serverless.md` | `@neondatabase/serverless` - HTTP/WebSocket queries |\n| Drizzle ORM       | `references/neon-drizzle.md`    | Drizzle ORM integration with Neon                   |\n\n### Auth & Data API SDKs\n\nAuthentication and PostgREST-style data API for Neon.\n\n| Area        | Resource                  | When to Use                                                         |\n| ----------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Neon Auth   | `references/neon-auth.md` | `@neondatabase/auth` - Authentication only                          |\n| Neon JS SDK | `references/neon-js.md`   | `@neondatabase/neon-js` - Auth + Data API (PostgREST-style queries) |\n\n### Neon Platform API & CLI\n\nManaging Neon resources programmatically via REST API, SDKs, or CLI.\n\n| Area                  | Resource                            | When to Use                                  |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| Platform API Overview | `references/neon-platform-api.md`   | Managing Neon resources via REST API         |\n| Neon CLI              | `references/neon-cli.md`            | Terminal workflows, scripts, CI/CD pipelines |\n| TypeScript SDK        | `references/neon-typescript-sdk.md` | `@neondatabase/api-client`                   |\n| Python SDK            | `references/neon-python-sdk.md`     | `neon-api` package                           |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:02.910Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Native Agents requiring seamless integration with serverless Postgres databases like Neon","zh":"适用于需要与无服务器Postgres数据库（如Neon）实现无缝集成的云原生代理","ja":"NeonのようなサーバーレスPostgresデータベースとのシームレスな統合を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに適しています","ko":"Neon과 같은 서버리스 Postgres 데이터베이스와의無縫な統合을 필요로 하는 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes Cloud Native que requieren una integración sin problemas con bases de datos Postgres sin servidor como Neon","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud Native nécessitant une intégration sans problème avec des bases de données Postgres sans serveur comme Neon","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit serverlosen Postgres-Datenbanken wie Neon erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que requerem integração perfeita com bancos de dados Postgres sem servidor, como o Neon","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции с серверными базами данных Postgres, такими как Neon","ar":"مثالي لعميل النUAGE الأصلي الذي يتطلب تكاملًا بدون مشاكل مع قواعد بيانات Postgres بدون خادم مثل Neon"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Neon''s autoscaling, branching, and instant restore features, while maintaining compatibility with standard Postgres protocols and libraries, streamlining database setup and connection management","zh":"赋予代理使用Neon的自动缩放、分支和即时还原功能的能力，同时保持与标准Postgres协议和库的兼容性，简化数据库设置和连接管理","ja":"Neonの自動スケーリング、ブランチ、インスタント復元機能を利用できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、標準のPostgresプロトコルとライブラリとの互換性を維持しながら、データベースの設定と接続管理を簡素化する","ko":"Neon의 자동 스케일링, 브랜치, 즉시 복원 기능을 활용할 수 있게 에이전트를 Empower하고, 표준 Postgres 프로토콜 및 라이브러리와의 호환성을 유지하면서 데이터베이스 설정 및 연결 관리를 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las características de escalabilidad automática, ramificación y restauración instantánea de Neon, manteniendo la compatibilidad con protocolos y bibliotecas Postgres estándar, simplificando la configuración y administración de la base de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les fonctionnalités d''auto-escalabilite, de ramification et de restauration instantanée de Neon, tout en maintenant la compatibilité avec les protocoles et les bibliothèques Postgres standard, simplifiant ainsi la configuration et la gestion de la base de données","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Neon''s Autoscaling-, Branching- und Instant-Restore-Features zu nutzen, während die Kompatibilität mit standardmäßigen Postgres-Protokollen und -Bibliotheken aufrechterhalten wird, wodurch die Datenbankkonfiguration und -verwaltung vereinfacht wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem os recursos de escalabilidade automática, ramificação e restauração instantânea do Neon, mantendo a compatibilidade com protocolos e bibliotecas Postgres padrão, simplificando a configuração e gerenciamento de conexões de banco de dados","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать функции автоматического масштабирования, ветвления и мгновенного восстановления Neon, сохраняя при этом совместимость со стандартными протоколами и библиотеками Postgres, упрощая настройку и управление подключениями к базе данных","ar":"يسمح للعميل باستخدام ميزات Neon للتحجيم التلقائي والتفرع والاستعادة الفورية، مع الحفاظ على التوافق مع بروتوكولات Postgres ومكتباتها القياسية، مبسطًا إعداد اتصالات قاعدة البيانات وإدارتها"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up and configuring Neon Serverless Postgres databases for scalable applications","Implementing branching and autoscaling strategies to optimize database performance","Integrating Neon with existing Postgres-compatible frameworks and ORMs for effortless migration"],"zh":["为可扩展应用程序设置和配置Neon Serverless Postgres数据库","实施分支和自动缩放策略以优化数据库性能","将Neon与现有的Postgres兼容框架和ORM集成以实现无缝迁移"],"ja":["拡張可能なアプリケーション用にNeon Serverless Postgresデータベースを設定および構成する","ブランチと自動スケーリング戦略を実装してデータベースパフォーマンスを最適化する","Neonを既存のPostgres互換フレームワークおよびORMと統合して無縫な移行を実現する"],"ko":["확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 위한 Neon Serverless Postgres 데이터베이스 설정 및 구성","데이터베이스 성능 최적화를 위한 브랜치 및 자동 스케일링 전략 구현","Neon을 기존 Postgres 호환 프레임워크 및 ORM과 통합하여 무중단 마이그레이션을 구현하는こと"],"es":["Configuración y configuración de bases de datos Postgres sin servidor de Neon para aplicaciones escalables","Implementación de estrategias de ramificación y escalabilidad automática para optimizar el rendimiento de la base de datos","Integración de Neon con frameworks y ORMs compatibles con Postgres existentes para una migración sin esfuerzo"],"fr":["Configuration et paramétrage des bases de données Postgres sans serveur de Neon pour des applications escalables","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de ramification et d''auto-escalabilite pour optimiser les performances de la base de données","Intégration de Neon avec des frameworks et des ORM compatibles Postgres existants pour une migration sans effort"],"de":["Einrichtung und Konfiguration von serverlosen Postgres-Datenbanken von Neon für skalierbare Anwendungen","Implementierung von Branching- und Autoscaling-Strategien zur Optimierung der Datenbankleistung","Integration von Neon mit bestehenden Postgres-kompatiblen Frameworks und ORMs für eine mühelose Migration"],"pt":["Configurar e configurar bancos de dados Neon Serverless Postgres para aplicações escaláveis","Implementar estratégias de ramificação e escalabilidade automática para otimizar o desempenho do banco de dados","Integrar o Neon com estruturas e ORMs compatíveis com Postgres existentes para uma migração sem esforço"],"ru":["Настройка и конфигурация серверных баз данных Postgres Neon для масштабируемых приложений","Реализация стратегий ветвления и автоматического масштабирования для оптимизации производительности базы данных","Интеграция Neon с существующими фреймворками и ORM, совместимыми с Postgres, для безусильной миграции"],"ar":["إعداد وتفصيل قواعد بيانات Postgres Serverless Neon للنظم القابلة للتوسعة","تنفيذ استراتيجيات التفرع والتحجيم التلقائي لتحسين أداء قاعدة البيانات","دمج Neon مع الإطارات وORM المتوافقة مع Postgres الحالية لتسهيل الهجرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a Neon Serverless Postgres account","Compatibility limited to Postgres-compatible languages, frameworks, and ORMs"],"zh":["需要Neon Serverless Postgres账户","兼容性仅限于Postgres兼容语言、框架和ORM"],"ja":["Neon Serverless Postgresアカウントが必要","互換性はPostgres互換言語、フレームワーク、ORMに限定される"],"ko":["Neon Serverless Postgres 계정이 필요합니다","호환성은 Postgres 호환 언어, 프레임워크, ORM에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Postgres sin servidor de Neon","Compatibilidad limitada a lenguajes, frameworks y ORMs compatibles con Postgres"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Postgres sans serveur de Neon","Compatibilité limi