INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ranbot-ai/awesome-skills/using-neon', 'using-neon', 'ranbot-ai', 'awesome-skills', 'community', 'using-neon ranbot-ai awesome-skills community The using-neon skill enables developers to work with Neon Serverless Postgres, setting up databases, choosing connection methods, and utilizing features like branching and autoscaling. Neon是一个服务器端Postgres平台，提供自动缩放、分支和即时恢复等功能，适用于任何语言、框架或ORM Neonは、自動スケーリング、ブランチ、インスタント復元などの機能を提供するサーバーレスPostgresプラットフォームで、任何言語、フレームワーク、またはORMで使用できます Neon은 자동 확장, 분기 및 즉시 복원 등의 기능을 제공하는 서버리스 Postgres 플랫폼으로,任何 언어, 프레임워크 또는 ORM에서 사용할 수 있습니다 Using-neon es una habilidad para trabajar con Neon Serverless Postgres, ofreciendo autoscaling y branching Using-neon est une compétence pour travailler avec Neon Serverless Postgres, offrant l''autoscaling et le branching Using-neon ist eine Fähigkeit, um mit Neon Serverless Postgres zu arbeiten, mit Autoscaling und Branching O Using-Neon é uma habilidade que permite a criação de workflows personalizados com Neon Serverless Postgres, oferecendo recursos como autodimensionamento e ramificação. Using-Neon - это навык, который позволяет создавать индивидуальные рабочие процессы с помощью Neon Serverless Postgres, предлагая функции, такие как автоскалинг и ветвление. Using-Neon هو مهارة تسمح بإنشاء سير عمل مخصصة مع Neon Serverless Postgres، وتقدم ميزات مثل التحكم التلقائي والتفرع. how to use using-neon what is using-neon using-neon alternative using-neon vs PostgreSQL using-neon install using-neon setup guide Neon Serverless Postgres tutorial using-neon for AI agents using-neon for database management Neon 服务器端Postgres 自动缩放 分支 即时恢复 Postgres兼容 服务器端开发 AIエージェント AI开发工具 Separates compute and storage for autoscaling and instant restore Fully compatible with Postgres and supports any language, framework, or ORM Enables branching for efficient database management Supports scale-to-zero for cost-effective resource allocation Offers instant restore for rapid database recovery Works with any connection method compatible with Postgres using-neon is a skill for customizing Claude AI workflows with Neon Serverless Postgres, a platform that separates compute and storage for autoscaling and instant restore.');
